msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "We feel safe behind this wall... it makes us sleepy..."
msgstr "这堵墙让我们觉得很安全...它让我们很想睡觉..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "We thought \"moon\" meant something totally different!"
msgstr "我们曾以为“月亮”代表着另一种完全不同的东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "Looks sturdy."
msgstr "看起来很坚固。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "Wow, these are really heavy."
msgstr "噢！太重了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "Bow to the base-building masters!"
msgstr "向建造营地的大师鞠躬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "These should come in handy."
msgstr "这些迟早派得上用场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Turns out wood burns really well."
msgstr "木头果然是最容易烧着的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Like a pillow fort, but wood!"
msgstr "像一座枕头城堡，不过是木头做的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "They won't keep us safe if we keep holding them."
msgstr "如果我们就这样拿着它们，那它们是没法保卫我们安全的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "I don't think he wants to be friends with us."
msgstr "他应该不想和我们交朋友吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "Reminds me of grandpa."
msgstr "让我想起了爷爷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "I think someone was here."
msgstr "我猜这里以前有人住过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe they'll invite us in?"
msgstr "也许他们会邀请我们进去？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "Maybe we can use it for arts and crafts."
msgstr "也许我们可以用它来合成其他东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "Fire fire fire!"
msgstr "燃烧，尽情地燃烧吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "We can't hide in there any more."
msgstr "我们再也不能躲在里面了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "We like to pop out and scare our friends sometimes. Haha!"
msgstr "有时我们喜欢蹦出来，吓吓朋友。哈哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "I don't think that puppy is very happy."
msgstr "这只狗狗看起来不太高兴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "The fire destroyed it."
msgstr "大火摧毁了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Let's put the torch in!"
msgstr "我们把火把放进去吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It wants to give us presents!"
msgstr "它想送我们礼物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "Sounds like anger!"
msgstr "它们好像发怒了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "We have to be gentle with our claws if we try to hold it!"
msgstr "握住爪爪时，得当心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "Looks tasty!"
msgstr "看起来好好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "This is the best idea anyone's ever had."
msgstr "这是所有人从过去到现在想出来的最好的点子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "Just the thing for a hot summer day."
msgstr "只属于炎炎夏日的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Anything can be cooked!"
msgstr "什么都能拿来做饭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "If we eat these will they grow inside us?"
msgstr "如果吃掉它们，它们会在我们体内生长吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s looks really mean. And tough."
msgstr "%s 看起来非常小气。强硬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You're supposed to put fires out when you're finished."
msgstr "你完成后应该把火灭掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Wow, %s! You're lookin' tough!"
msgstr "哇，%s！你看起来很结实！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "Wow! Even as a ghost you're super tough, %s!"
msgstr "哇！就算是个鬼魂，你也超级结实，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "We're not scared of pointy spearsticks! Fight!"
msgstr "我们不害怕尖头棒！战斗！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a super valiant lady."
msgstr "%s 是个超级英勇的女士。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "Haha! It's way too big for us!"
msgstr "哈哈！对我们来说太大了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Why have paper you can't draw on?"
msgstr "为什么会有你不能在上面画画的纸张呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s looks eviler than usual..."
msgstr "%s 看上去比平常更邪恶..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't burn our things please. We like them."
msgstr "不要烧掉我们的东西。我们喜欢它们。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! Lookin' dapper!"
msgstr "嗨，%s！看起来不错呦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "Aw %s, no one deserves to be stuck like that!"
msgstr "哦，%s ，没有人应该被那样定住！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "You're the real monster, %s!"
msgstr "你是个地道的怪物，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "Wow, %s is really nice! He's helping people!"
msgstr "哇，%s 真棒！他帮助人们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
msgid "I don't think we should play with that..."
msgstr "我认为我们不应该玩那个….."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Ah! We look scary when we're mad!"
msgstr "啊哈！我们生气时会很可怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Spiderfriend, why did you light that fire?"
msgstr "蜘蛛友人，为什么你点着那堆火？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "A spiderfriend! Hi %s!"
msgstr "一个蜘蛛友人！嗨，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "Oh no! We should help ourselves!"
msgstr "哦，不！我们应该帮助自己！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "We won't let you hurt our friends!"
msgstr "我们不想让你伤害我们的朋友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s likes helping ghosts, just like us."
msgstr "%s 喜欢帮助鬼魂，这和我们一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "How did this get here?"
msgstr "这东西是怎么到这里来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "We'll protect each other, spider babies!"
msgstr "我们互相保护吧，蜘蛛宝宝们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Are you angry at me, %s?"
msgstr "你生我的气了，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Uhh, uh-oh, let's play a different game, %s."
msgstr "唔，唔哦，玩个不一样的游戏吧，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! Let's play, okay?"
msgstr "嗨，%s！我们一起玩吧，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry! Our spider friends will help bring you back!"
msgstr "别担心！蜘蛛朋友会把你带回来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "We're taking my friendship bracelet back!"
msgstr "我们去把我的友谊手链拿回来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s always plays nice with ghosts."
msgstr "%s 总是和鬼魂们玩得不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "Maybe we can talk this out?"
msgstr "可能我们可以公开谈这个？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You were just supposed to mime lighting it!"
msgstr "你刚才应该模仿点着它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey! Hi %s!"
msgstr "嘿！嗨，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "We'll help you get back on your feet, %s!"
msgstr "我们帮你从头再来，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "You're supposed to play nice!"
msgstr "你应该打得不错！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is super nice. And his makeup's cool!"
msgstr "%s 超级好。他的装扮也很酷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "Experimenting is fun!"
msgstr "至少是一次有趣的尝试！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "It'll probably dry off soon. Maybe."
msgstr "它可能很快就会变干。或许吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "We hope the stuff inside didn't get smushed."
msgstr "我希望里面的东西不要被压扁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "Oooh, it makes so much noise!"
msgstr "噢，它制造了这么多的噪音！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "Uh-oh! We're in trouble with Ms. %s!"
msgstr "哦喔！我们与 %s 女士有麻烦了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Ms. %s! We already had our combustion lessons!"
msgstr "%s 女士！我们已经上过燃烧课了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello Ms. %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s 女士！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry Ms. %s, we'll find you a heart!"
msgstr "别担心，%s 女士，我们会帮你找一个心脏的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Killer! Does this mean we don't have to do our homework?!"
msgstr "杀手！所以我们不用写作业了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "Ms. %s is very smart and wise. She's neat!"
msgstr "%s 女士非常聪明睿智。她干净整洁！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s's playing with fire. Err..."
msgstr "%s 在玩火。呃..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Another fire? Well, as long as you're happy..."
msgstr "又放火？呃，你开心就好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! How's Bernie?"
msgstr "嗨，%s！伯尼好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "Uh-oh! Does that hurt, %s?"
msgstr "噢哦！疼吗，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "You're gonna get burned, %s!"
msgstr "你是引火烧身，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "She's like a burnt marshmallow. Crispy outside, super mushy inside!"
msgstr "她就像是一颗烧焦的棉花糖，外脆内软！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "Why are you being so mean, %s?"
msgstr "你干嘛这么小气，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Uh... Is your hair smoking, %s?"
msgstr "呃...你头发冒烟了吗，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! Nice weather we're having!"
msgstr "嗨，%s！天气不错！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "You're looking much paler than usual, %s!"
msgstr "你比平常看起来更苍白，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Meanie! We will stop you no matter what!"
msgstr "小气鬼！我们无论如何也会阻止你的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "%s doesn't believe in ghosts, but he believes in us!"
msgstr "%s 不相信鬼魂，但他相信我们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "Don't do hits, %s!"
msgstr "%s，别动手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't light fires, %s!"
msgstr "%s，别点火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! Build anything neat today?"
msgstr "嗨，%s！今天做了什么好东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "Aw, I'm sorry that happened to you, %s."
msgstr "啊，%s，很抱歉这发生在你身上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! We didn't wanna have to do this!"
msgstr "凶手！我们是迫不得已的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "%s keeps us all together."
msgstr "%s 将我们连系在一起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "Oh, oh!"
msgstr "噢，噢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no! It got burnt!"
msgstr "不！被烧掉了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "Machines think gem power is really tasty."
msgstr "机器们觉得宝石的力量很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "We think it's running low."
msgstr "我们认为电量在降低。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF"
msgid "Winoooona! The thing broke!"
msgstr "薇-诺-诺-娜！这玩意坏了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING"
msgid "Oh, oh!"
msgstr "噢，噢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no! It got burnt!"
msgstr "不！被烧掉了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC"
msgid "It feeds hungry machines."
msgstr "它能喂饱饥饿的机器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER"
msgid "We think it's running low."
msgstr "我们认为电量在降低。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF"
msgid "Hey Winona! How do we fix it?"
msgstr "嗨，薇诺娜！我们怎么修好它呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING"
msgid "Oh, oh!"
msgstr "噢，噢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no! It got burnt!"
msgstr "不！被烧掉了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC"
msgid "We feel safer already!"
msgstr "我们觉得安全多了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF"
msgid "How come it's not on?"
msgstr "怎么没开机呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
msgid "Oh, oh!"
msgstr "噢，噢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no! It got burnt!"
msgstr "不！被烧掉了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "She made us a nightlight!"
msgstr "她给我们做了一盏夜灯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF"
msgid "How come it's not on?"
msgstr "怎么没开机呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "Mum always said I should take a cap with me."
msgstr "妈妈总是说我应该戴一顶帽子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "How come everything turns to ashes? It's sad."
msgstr "怎么一切都化为灰烬了？真让人难过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "How hot is it, Mr. Thermal Measurer?"
msgstr "温度计先生，现在多少度？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "I won't eat it. It's our friend now."
msgstr "我不吃它。它现在是我们的朋友了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "Icy icy icing!"
msgstr "冰冰冰冻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "Eat twenty candy canes! There's no candy shame!"
msgstr "吃了二十块拐杖糖！对糖果好不感到羞愧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "Yuck! What is that??"
msgstr "恶心！那是什么？？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "Haha, Wendy! Watch our Woodie impression!"
msgstr "哈哈，温蒂！看看我们的伍德印象！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "Where are the plums?"
msgstr "李子在哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Apple juice?! Yes!!"
msgstr "苹果汁？！是的！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "It makes our claws and tummy so warm."
msgstr "它让我们的爪子和肚子如此温暖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "It's really, really good!"
msgstr "它真的真的很好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Can we get a boost? We can't reach the treetop."
msgstr "可以推我们一把吗？我们爬不上树的顶部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "Wow, that one looks great!"
msgstr "哇，那东西看起来很棒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "Not so scary when they're like this."
msgstr "它们这个样子没那么可怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "Huh. It kinda looks...goaty!"
msgstr "哈。它看起来有点...像羊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "We want to keep one for ourselves."
msgstr "我们想要自己保留一个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Nooo! The tree!"
msgstr "不不！树！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Aw... Why..."
msgstr "啊...为什么..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "Winter's Feast! It's Winter's Feast!"
msgstr "冬日盛会！是冬日盛会！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It still needs to grow some more."
msgstr "它仍然需要在种更多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "Aw... Why..."
msgstr "啊...为什么..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just a boring planter without a tree."
msgstr "只是一个没有树的无聊的种植园主。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey %s, you look upset about something."
msgstr "嘿，%s，你看起来不开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s, no!! Fire can hurt you!"
msgstr "%s，不！！火会伤害你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! Have you been working out?"
msgstr "嗨，%s！你解决了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "I'm sure you're the strongest ghost. Let's get a heart though."
msgstr "我肯定你是最强大的。让我们去弄个心脏来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "You're just a big bully!"
msgstr "你就是个大恶棍！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's nice! I wish he'd stop messing up our head fur, though."
msgstr "%s 真棒！但我希望他不要再把我们头上的毛发弄成一团糟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s looks angry today."
msgstr "今天 %s 看起来生气了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "%s's being gnawghty."
msgstr "%s 在淘气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "Can I pet your ears or will our claws swish through?"
msgstr "我能摸摸你耳朵吗，要不我们挥挥爪子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Um. I think you lit a fire, %s."
msgstr "嗯，你点了把火，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s, hi Lucy!"
msgstr "嗨，%s，嗨，露西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "Wanna go heart-hunting with us, %s?"
msgstr "和我们一起去狩猎心脏吗，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "You need to treat people nicer, %s!"
msgstr "你要对大家更好点，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is gruff, but nice."
msgstr "%s 是个坏脾气，但人不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Some dirt, big whoop."
msgstr "一堆泥土，没什么大不了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "What could possibly go wrong?"
msgstr "总感觉有什么不对劲呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "Creepy crawly!"
msgstr "可怕的爬行动物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I think that thing is alive."
msgstr "我觉得那个东西是活的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "I've been in worse."
msgstr "更糟糕的地方我都去过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "Gross, that one looks sick!"
msgstr "呃，那个看起来好恶心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "It's gushing with light."
msgstr "它在发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "I dare you to eat it!"
msgstr "我打赌你不敢吃它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "What could possibly go wrong?"
msgstr "总感觉有什么不对劲呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey, play nice, %s!"
msgstr "嘿, 规矩点, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't play tricks, Mr. Imp!"
msgstr "恶魔先生，别耍花样！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey %s! Your horns look nice!"
msgstr "嘿， %s! 你的角看着还行啊!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Oh no, %s! You're hurt!"
msgstr "哎呀, %s! 你受伤了!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Oh no! %s, what did you do!"
msgstr "哎呀! %s, 你都干了些什么!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Grandpa always said laughter was the best medicine!"
msgstr "爷爷总是说微笑是最好的药品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "We thought you were a friendly robot, %s!"
msgstr "我们认为你是个友好的机器人，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Maybe they didn't know fire is dangerous to us."
msgstr "可能它们不知道火对我们有危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! You look very non-organic today!"
msgstr "嗨，%s。你今天看起来非常无机！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "Bad day destroying humans, %s? Tomorrow will be better!"
msgstr "坏日子摧毁了人类，%s？明天会更好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "Let us introduce you to our world wide web! Sh-sha!"
msgstr "来试试我们的互联网！嘘—嗄！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "Aww. We'd beep-boop %s on the nose if they had one!"
msgstr "噢！我们哔卟 %s 的鼻子，要是他们有一个的话！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "Nice and glowy."
msgstr "好东西，还会发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "Yellow-bellied gem."
msgstr "黄色的宝石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Even with all our eyes, we'd still lose in a staring contest."
msgstr "即使用上我们所有的眼睛，我们还是会输掉瞪眼比赛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "We summon you, warm ball of light!"
msgstr "我们召唤你，温暖的光团！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "Yummy!"
msgstr "好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Mmmmmm."
msgstr "嗯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Smells good."
msgstr "真香。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "Can we play with it?"
msgstr "我们能玩这个吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Uh-oh. I smell burning!"
msgstr "啊哦。我闻到了燃烧的味道！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "All our eyes stopped working!"
msgstr "我们的所有眼睛都停止了工作！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "What if it hatches in our belly?"
msgstr "要是它在我们的肚子里孵出来怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "Don't eat us!"
msgstr "别吃我们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Oh no! We burnt it!"
msgstr "不好！烧焦了!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Oh no! That wasn't a recipe!"
msgstr "哎呀，那不是食谱！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "I'm ready to go home now!"
msgstr "我准备好回家了!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I can't open it without a key."
msgstr "没有钥匙，我就打不开它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I can't... I don't feel so good..."
msgstr "我不能...我感觉不太好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I can only have one..."
msgstr "我只能有一个..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I can't place that from this lofty position."
msgstr "我不能把它从崇高的位置上弄下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "I guess I won't be changing again anytime soon."
msgstr "我猜最近都换不了衣服了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "What's the point."
msgstr "有什么意义。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "I'd like to use that after you. If you don't mind, I mean."
msgstr "我会在你之后使用那个。我是说你不介意的话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "Nothing comes of nothing."
msgstr "无中生无。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "No one wants to share with me."
msgstr "没有人愿意和我分享。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "I can't do anything right."
msgstr "我什么都做不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "It doesn't go there. I know the feeling."
msgstr "它不是放在那里的。我知道这种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh. No one ever taught me to cook."
msgstr "呃。没人教过我怎么做饭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "What are you making...? Smells good..."
msgstr "你在做什么…？好香…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "It's so... far away..."
msgstr "它太...远了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "I draw better with references..."
msgstr "有参照物我会画得更好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "Why isn't it working, Abigail?"
msgstr "阿比盖尔，为什么它不运行？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "It's too busy to pay attention to me..."
msgstr "它太忙了，没空理会我..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It has no will to live."
msgstr "它没有生存的意志。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "They've no need of material possessions where they've gone."
msgstr "它们去的地方不需要任何物质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "Oh... my information's useless..."
msgstr "哦...我的信息没用..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "It hasn't yet eaten our last sacrifice..."
msgstr "它还没有吃掉我们上次供奉的祭品..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "No... I can't..."
msgstr "不...我不能..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "Some things should stay dead."
msgstr "有些事情就那样吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "It doesn't need that. It needs a magic log."
msgstr "它不需要那东西。它需要一块魔法木头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "It doesn't need that. It needs a mushroom."
msgstr "它不需要那东西。它需要一个蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "I can't... not in here."
msgstr "我不能......这里不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That may not be best..."
msgstr "那恐怕不好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "I don't think that will work there..."
msgstr "我不认为那东西在那里会有用..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I think that's... wrong..."
msgstr "我觉得...错了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "That's not the right thing..."
msgstr "那不是正确的东西..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "Danger lurks. There's no time for games."
msgstr "危险潜伏着。没有玩的时间了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "Help me clean up, Abigail."
msgstr "帮我清理一下，阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "It's much too late for games."
msgstr "已经太晚，没时间玩了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Another time. It's enjoying a temporary death right now..."
msgstr "下次吧。现在它正在体验临时死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "There's no room..."
msgstr "没有空间..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "I got it wrong... again..."
msgstr "我...又搞错了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "These bones are grimly misassembled..."
msgstr "这些骨头胡乱拼装起来，怪可怕的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "Oh... I can tell you're busy..."
msgstr "哦…我能看得出来你很忙…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "They have no need of material possessions where they've gone."
msgstr "它们去的地方不需要任何物质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "They're already too burdened by this world..."
msgstr "他们已经为这个世界操心太多…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They look so peaceful... I'll come back later."
msgstr "他们看起来很平和…我一会儿再回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "Oh... I can tell you're busy..."
msgstr "哦…我能看得出来你很忙…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "They have no need of material possessions where they've gone."
msgstr "它们去的地方不需要任何物质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "They're already too burdened by this world..."
msgstr "他们已经为这个世界操心太多…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They look so peaceful... I'll come back later."
msgstr "他们看起来很平和…我很快就回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE"
msgid "I'll have to be quicker to the saddle next time."
msgstr "下次我会更快点爬上鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "I'll wait for it to calm down..."
msgstr "我会等到它冷静下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's beat me to it."
msgstr "有人抢在了我前面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION"
msgid "No... I don't want that..."
msgstr "不...我不想要那个..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE"
msgid "Will I never make the pieces fit in this pitiful life?"
msgstr "恐怕永远都不能把这些碎片放到悲惨的人生中？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH"
msgid "Like my soul, this food doesn't belong in this vessel."
msgstr "这道菜不应装在这个容器里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH"
msgid "I've already put this on a dish."
msgstr "我已经把它装盘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Must everything in life be hard?"
msgstr "生命经历的一切都必须这么艰难吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE"
msgid "I can come back later..."
msgstr "我可以晚点回来..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "I'll wait for it to calm down..."
msgstr "我会等到它冷静下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO"
msgid "I'd prefer to be blanketed by the night for this."
msgstr "我宁愿在夜色的遮掩下干这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not taking a razor to that."
msgstr "我才不要拿剃刀对着那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS"
msgid "She's already lost everything."
msgstr "她已经失去了一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC"
msgid "It wouldn't fit."
msgstr "装不下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE"
msgid "Can I use that after you?"
msgstr "我可以在你之后用那个吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "I must mind my manners."
msgstr "我必须注意我的举止。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN"
msgid "That knowledge is beyond me..."
msgstr "那个知识太深奥了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN"
msgid "I already possess that knowledge..."
msgstr "我已经掌握了那个知识..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD"
msgid "It's... not right..."
msgstr "这是...不对的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS"
msgid "Death would surely find me if I tried..."
msgstr "如果我试了，死亡肯定会找到我的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY"
msgid "Should I give up, or find another key?"
msgstr "我应该放弃，还是去寻找另一把钥匙？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY"
msgid "It remains locked, like my heart."
msgstr "它还是打不开，就像我的心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I can't wrap nothingness..."
msgstr "我没办法把虚无打包起来..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC"
msgid "I... I can't."
msgstr "我...我做不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE"
msgid "Take your time... I'll just watch."
msgstr "抓紧时间…我看着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC"
msgid "I can't do anything right."
msgstr "我什么都做不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT"
msgid "All of this is transient."
msgstr "这一切都是短暂的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE"
msgid "This will be forgotten too, some day."
msgstr "有一天，这个也会被忘记的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL"
msgid "Not all deaths are alike."
msgstr "并不是所有死亡都是相似的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1"
msgid "Oh, now what?"
msgstr "哦，又怎么了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2"
msgid "The ground crumbles beneath me."
msgstr "我脚下的地面正在崩溃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3"
msgid "May the earth swallow me whole."
msgstr "大地要把我整个吸进去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1"
msgid "A gift..."
msgstr "一个礼物..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2"
msgid "We pay tribute, this day..."
msgstr "我们致敬，今天..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3"
msgid "Its bloodlust is temporarily quenched."
msgstr "它的杀戮欲暂时平息了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "The dead shall rise."
msgstr "死者应起立。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "The beasts are coming."
msgstr "野兽来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3"
msgid "Death is coming for us."
msgstr "死神向我们袭来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST"
msgid "oOoooooO!!"
msgstr "呜呜呜呜呜！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BEES"
msgid "Bees! Maybe I'm allergic!"
msgstr "蜜蜂！也许我过敏！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG"
msgid "Ow! That was karma."
msgstr "噢！这就是报应。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION"
msgid "Bats can't scare me anymore. I can return to my melancholy."
msgstr "蝙蝠吓不到我了。我可以回到惆怅之中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_BURNT"
msgid "Ow! Fires of Hell!"
msgstr "噢！地狱之火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX"
msgid "\nUnlike my heart, this could be mended."
msgstr "\n不像我的心，这个可以修补。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN"
msgid "We're going to be crushed..."
msgstr "我们要被压碎了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE"
msgid "Demon! Show yourself!"
msgstr "恶魔！现身吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK"
msgid "I am attacked!"
msgstr "我被攻击了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_COLD"
msgid "I am chilled to the bone."
msgstr "我感到彻骨的寒冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "It feels the force of the earth no more."
msgstr "它再也不能感觉到大地的力量了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "I lack the necessary materials."
msgstr "我缺少必要的材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "Soggy and sad."
msgstr "打湿了，有点难过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "That could be bad."
msgstr "不好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "Abigail?"
msgstr "阿比盖尔？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Your death has been delayed another day."
msgstr "你的死期又一次被延迟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "The sickly sweet scent of roses fills the air..."
msgstr "空气中飘满了玫瑰矫情的香味…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Yum!"
msgstr "好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "I would never."
msgstr "绝不。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "That was not edible."
msgstr "那个不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "That food was nearing the end of its lifetime."
msgstr "这个食物已经接近生命的尾声了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "Was that stale?"
msgstr "不新鲜了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "I fear consuming that."
msgstr "我害怕吃那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "I must carry... my own burden..."
msgstr "我自己的包袱...必须我自己扛..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "I don't... need help..."
msgstr "我不需要...帮助..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "Life... is a trial..."
msgstr "生活...就像一场试验..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "...huff..."
msgstr "...呼..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "Hhnnfg..."
msgstr "哼..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "...Suffering..."
msgstr "...折磨..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "I'm... okay..."
msgstr "我...没事..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "Don't worry... Abby... I got it..."
msgstr "别担心...艾比...我能行..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "The darkness has swallowed me."
msgstr "黑暗吞没了我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "And there was light!"
msgstr "那儿有光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "The fan has breathed its last."
msgstr "风扇呼出了最后一口气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM"
msgid "Freedom. Great."
msgstr "自由，太好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "The ghosts... Want to play..."
msgstr "鬼魂…想玩…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "I have seen the void and it is deep and dark."
msgstr "我看到了虚空，它深沉而又黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "I am miserably hot."
msgstr "热死我了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "The hounds are baying."
msgstr "猎犬在狂吠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "I am full of emptiness."
msgstr "我感到无尽的空虚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "I sense the beast's presence nearby."
msgstr "我感觉附近有野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "This trail leads nowhere."
msgstr "这个痕迹没有指向任何地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "No trail, just a bunch of muck."
msgstr "没有痕迹，只有一堆泥土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER"
msgid "It could use a bit more."
msgstr "它需要多一点肥料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL"
msgid "I can carry no more."
msgstr "我带不了更多东西了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP"
msgid "Your pleas will fall on deaf ears."
msgstr "你的恳求只会碰到听不见的耳朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE"
msgid "Death walks among us."
msgstr "死亡行走在我们中间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "The beast returns unchained."
msgstr "野兽回来了，它的枷锁解开了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "Yet, again I wake to life. Sigh."
msgstr "我又一次醒过来了。唉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "So close to death, yet so far."
msgstr "离死亡这么近，又那么远。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "Pithy knowledge..."
msgstr "浅薄的知识..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS"
msgid "Mosquitoes! Let my veins be a feast!"
msgstr "蚊子！尽情享用我的鲜血吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "This beast... is not long for this world."
msgstr "这野兽...不再留恋这个世界。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK"
msgid "I can't let my guard down right now..."
msgstr "现在我不能放松警惕…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT"
msgid "There's no time for presents, death has finally come for me!"
msgstr "没有时间去管礼物了，死亡终于来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA"
msgid "I couldn't possibly nap. Death is nigh."
msgstr "我连打个盹都不行。死亡近在眼前。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can't sleep, there's death to be had."
msgstr "我不能睡，可能会死的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
msgid "The sun upsets me. I couldn't possibly sleep."
msgstr "阳光让我烦躁。我没法睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
msgid "I'm not tired yet."
msgstr "我还不累。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA"
msgid "My stomach is as empty as my heart. I can't nap now."
msgstr "我的胃就像我的心灵一样空虚。我现在不能睡午觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
msgid "My stomach is as empty as my heart. I can't sleep now."
msgstr "我的胃就像我的心灵一样空虚。我现在不能睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "Can someone help me down... I have a present to open."
msgstr "有人帮我放下吗...我有个礼物要打开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "I'd really rather be in a tent."
msgstr "我真的宁愿是在帐篷里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "I'd really rather be in a tent."
msgstr "我真的宁愿是在帐篷里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "That'd be quite the way to go out."
msgstr "这是个解脱的好法子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "Sadly, it is ablaze."
msgstr "可惜，着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "I was expecting great difficulty."
msgstr "我预想会有巨大的困难。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "You try my patience."
msgstr "你在试探我的耐心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "A wave of sadness just washed over me...?"
msgstr "一波哀愁袭过我心头…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Smells like death."
msgstr "闻起来像死亡的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "The ground shakes. Will it swallow me whole?"
msgstr "大地在晃动。它会将我整个吞没吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "It has spirits to protect it..."
msgstr "它有精灵保护它..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "I now possess greater knowledge of this terrible world."
msgstr "我现在掌握了更多关于这个糟糕世界的知识。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Thank-you..."
msgstr "谢...谢你..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "All done."
msgstr "搞定了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "You'll not glimpse death today..."
msgstr "你今天不会看见死神了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "The dead are risen."
msgstr "死而复生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "We failed... again..."
msgstr "我们又一次...失败了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "It accepted our items."
msgstr "它接受了我的物品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Nature is good for something after all."
msgstr "大自然毕竟有好的一面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "I am caged!"
msgstr "我被关在笼子里了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "A veritable apocalypse of water."
msgstr "真正称得上是“水的启示录”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Did you see that, Abigail?"
msgstr "你看见了吗，阿比盖尔？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Ow! Prickly, like me."
msgstr "噢！像我一样扎手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "A blessing in disguise."
msgstr "因祸得福。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "It's gone. The earth swallowed it whole..."
msgstr "它没了。土地把它全吞了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "I hope it doesn't try to escape..."
msgstr "希望它不会试着逃出去..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "Oh well, I didn't need it anyways."
msgstr "哦，好吧，反正我也不需要它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "Darkness has returned!"
msgstr "黑暗再次降临！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Did I die?"
msgstr "我死了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "Oh, goodness."
msgstr "噢，天哪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "Ouch. That was unnecessary."
msgstr "哎哟。没那个必要。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WET"
msgid "Even wetter than when I cry myself to sleep."
msgstr "比我在哭泣中睡去还要湿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WETTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WETTER"
msgid "An eternity of moisture and sorrow."
msgstr "无尽的潮湿和悲伤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE"
msgid "I emerge into this world once more."
msgstr "我又一次出现在这个世界。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WORMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_WORMS"
msgid "Uh-oh. I think we should leave."
msgstr "啊哦。我想我们该离开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.DEER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.DEER"
msgid "Your life is mine!"
msgstr "你的命归我了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.GENERIC"
msgid "Death will find you!"
msgstr "死亡会找上你的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "Let death embrace you!"
msgstr "让死亡拥抱你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.PREY"
msgid "Suffer, worm!"
msgstr "受死吧，虫子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.SPIDER"
msgid "I shall send you to the other side!"
msgstr "我会把你送到另一个世界！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "I will be your end!"
msgstr "我会干掉你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
msgid "You shall live. For now."
msgstr "你应该活着，至少目前不能死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG"
msgid "You've eluded death today, beast."
msgstr "今天你逃过了一死，野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY"
msgid "You'll appreciate the gift of life better now."
msgstr "现在你会更珍惜生命的礼物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER"
msgid "You should be thankful I'm sparing you."
msgstr "你应该感谢我饶你一命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "I won't forget this."
msgstr "我不会忘了这件事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL"
msgid "That's my twin sister, Abigail."
msgstr "那是我的孪生姐姐，阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's still so pretty."
msgstr "它还是这么美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "I need to show Abigail how to play."
msgstr "我需要教阿比盖尔怎么玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "Abigail is ready to play, but she needs some space."
msgstr "阿比盖尔准备好了，但她需要一点空间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "It was my sister's flower. She's gone far away."
msgstr "这是我姐姐的花。她去了很远的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "I can sense Abigail's presence growing stronger."
msgstr "我能感觉到阿比盖尔的气息越来越强了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "Abigail is almost here!"
msgstr "阿比盖尔就快到了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "I've never much cared for metaphor."
msgstr "我向来不太关心隐喻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "A tiny life, ensconced in brittle death."
msgstr "藏身于脆弱死亡中的渺小生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted dead."
msgstr "被烤死的小东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "A tree will grow soon."
msgstr "一棵树很快就会长出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "What technological terror is this?"
msgstr "这是哪门子的技术恐怖行动？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "I wonder who used to own this."
msgstr "我想知道它以前的主人是谁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "It is full of the echoes of the dead."
msgstr "它充满了死亡的回音。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "I hear the painful echoes of the dead."
msgstr "我听到了死者的痛苦回声。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "Not very attractive."
msgstr "不太有吸引力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "Signs of the beast."
msgstr "野兽的痕迹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "Do you know any riddles?"
msgstr "你知道任何谜语吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "A deep rage brews within..."
msgstr "一股深沉的愤怒正在酝酿..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "The gifts made it happier..."
msgstr "礼物让它更高兴了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "If only I could kick it."
msgstr "要是能踢一下就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "I'd wear it inside-out."
msgstr "我想把它反过来穿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "To prolong the inevitable."
msgstr "延迟不可避免的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "Could stop the daggers that stab at mine heart."
msgstr "可以阻挡那把刺向我心脏的利刃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "A reprieve from death."
msgstr "可以暂缓死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "I shall wrap myself in death's sweet embrace."
msgstr "我应该用死者的甜蜜拥抱伪装我自己。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "A clinging, dreary, living suit."
msgstr "贴身、沉闷、有生命的装束。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "A suit to hide from one's problems."
msgstr "隐瞒某人问题的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "To hold off the inevitable a bit longer."
msgstr "拖延一下不可避免的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "A perfectly safe way to go insane."
msgstr "最安全的发疯方法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "Transient, indeed."
msgstr "转瞬即逝啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "A mark is made, however transient."
msgstr "我做了个标记，不过是暂时的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "Its blank face shall soon offer a secret."
msgstr "它一脸茫然，很快便会透露秘密。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Transient, indeed."
msgstr "转瞬即逝啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "A mark is made, however transient."
msgstr "我做了个标记，不过是暂时的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "Its blank face shall soon offer a secret."
msgstr "它一脸茫然，很快便会透露秘密。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "All that's left after another beautiful fire."
msgstr "另一场熊熊大火过后只剩下这些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "The eyebone was incinerated in the teleportation!"
msgstr "传送的时候，眼骨被烧成灰了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "The flower was incinerated in the teleportation!"
msgstr "传送的时候，花被烧成灰了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "This was once some thing before it got burned..."
msgstr "在被烧毁前，它曾经是某样东西…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "Take us far from here."
msgstr "带我们离开这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "We can't do that again for awhile."
msgstr "我们好一会无法再这样做了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "Oh well. I hope it's a quick death."
msgstr "噢，好啊。 我希望来个痛快的了断。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "A beacon of hope left unlit... How fitting."
msgstr "希望的灯塔没有被照亮...真是太合适了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "Hope springs infernal."
msgstr "无处不在的烈焰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "I think I know where it goes..."
msgstr "我觉得我知道它去哪了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "There is no light to be found."
msgstr "找不到光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "A deathly light dances across the room."
msgstr "死一般的光线在房间里舞动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "Scrawlings of a tongue lost to time."
msgstr "语言的乱涂乱写败给了时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "A people struck by famine and sorrow."
msgstr "人们受到饥荒和悲伤的打击。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "A piece of their story, lost to time."
msgstr "他们的故事，输给了时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "They are consumed by darkness."
msgstr "他们被黑暗吞噬了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "Then, rebirth."
msgstr "然后，重生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "Finally, a city, full of life."
msgstr "最后，城市里充满了生机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "A tortured soul."
msgstr "一个受折磨的灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "An instrument for industry and murder."
msgstr "用于工业和谋杀的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Enjoy your youth. Soon you will learn the terrors of the real world."
msgstr "享受你的童年吧。很快你就会知道现实世界的残酷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "Don't wake up."
msgstr "不要醒过来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "A spacious sack to increase one's burden."
msgstr "大布袋可以提升装载力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "A balanced breakfast to start another miserable day."
msgstr "吃了这份营养均衡的早餐，新的悲惨一天又开始了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "A colorful reminder that my childhood is no more."
msgstr "一个彩色的提示，我的童年已不再。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "These look as deflated as I feel..."
msgstr "如同我的内心，泄了气..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "There's no salve for the pain of existence."
msgstr "没有药膏可以缓解存在的痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "Trying to break it would be pointless."
msgstr "尝试破坏它是毫无意义的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "A creature of the night."
msgstr "夜行生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "An enchanted weapon. How exciting!"
msgstr "一件附魔武器。多么令人兴奋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "They're just lurking in there..."
msgstr "它们只是潜伏在那里面..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "If only I could fly away."
msgstr "要是我也能飞走就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "They once held such great potential."
msgstr "它们曾经拥有如此大的潜力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "That's just nasty."
msgstr "真脏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "It could crush me in one blow. I wish it would."
msgstr "它一巴掌就能把我拍扁。我希望它这样做。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "Death surrounds us. Well, our torsos anyhow."
msgstr "死亡围绕着我们的躯干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "It smells like death."
msgstr "闻起来像死亡的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "For veiling oneself in the fuzzy skins of the fallen."
msgstr "用死去动物的毛皮把自己盖起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "Sleep is but a temporary death."
msgstr "睡眠只是短暂的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd steer clear of that stinger."
msgstr "我要避开毒刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "Be still, little one."
msgstr "别乱动，小家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt honey."
msgstr "蜂蜜烧掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "Their toils have been fruitful!"
msgstr "它们的辛勤工作收获颇丰!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Their stolen labor tastes so sweet."
msgstr "他们偷来的劳动成果如此美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "Work, bees!"
msgstr "干活，小蜜蜂！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "Their toils have been fruitful!"
msgstr "它们的辛勤工作收获颇丰!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Toil on."
msgstr "再加把劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "I wonder if it misses its old family?"
msgstr "我在想，它是否想念原来的家庭？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "He follows me unto his doom."
msgstr "他跟着我走向他的末日。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "What demented thoughts must lie behind those eyes."
msgstr "那些眼睛背后一定藏有什么疯狂的想法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "His nakedness is now on display."
msgstr "他现在赤身裸体了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "The world has wronged you."
msgstr "世界错待了你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "More of the world is within the beast than without."
msgstr "这世界满是野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "Together we can venture far."
msgstr "我们可以一起冒险到远方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "To sleep, perchance to dream."
msgstr "睡觉，偶尔做梦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "To cover one's head."
msgstr "盖住某人的头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Somewhere, a beefalo is naked and cold."
msgstr "在某个地方，一头牦牛正光着身子受冻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "Their devotion knows no bounds."
msgstr "它们的奉献没有边界。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "This will protect me from those happy buzzing sounds. Oh, and stings."
msgstr "有了这个，我再也不用害怕那些快乐的嗡嗡声，也不用害怕那些毒刺了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "A wretched hive of scum and pollen."
msgstr "充满渣滓和花粉的可悲蜂窝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "They're still alive in there. Poor things."
msgstr "它们在那里面还是活的。可怜的小东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "The furious creatures appreciate their freedom in retrospect."
msgstr "里面暴怒的生物无比怀念往昔的自由。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "As regal as she is ruthless..."
msgstr "她是个无情的帝皇..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "The bees left their sweet mark upon the earth."
msgstr "蜜蜂把它们甜美的标记留在土地上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "It is not a danger... yet..."
msgstr "她暂时...不构成危险..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "Dripping with enmity. And honey."
msgstr "滴落着敌意，和蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "It's useless on its own, just like me."
msgstr "它本身是没有用的，就像我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR"
msgid "You are a prisoner of your own doomed destiny."
msgstr "你是自己悲惨命运的囚徒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "Ring in the dead."
msgstr "死亡的铃声。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "He dances to forget the pain."
msgstr "他跳舞跳到忘记痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "He has passed."
msgstr "他已经通过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "He's had a rough life."
msgstr "他过了艰难的一生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "These berries are tart."
msgstr "这些浆果很酸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "More balanced flavor, but they won't last long."
msgstr "味道更均衡，但过不了多久它们就会腐烂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "I'd better consume these before death does."
msgstr "我最好在死亡吃掉他们之前吃掉这些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "This hasn't halted the decay, merely stalled it."
msgstr "这不会暂停变质，只是在拖延。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "It is barren."
msgstr "它荒芜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Its suffering will end soon."
msgstr "它的痛苦马上就会结束。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It's not long for this world..."
msgstr "它不在这个世界呆不久了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "It is on the precipice..."
msgstr "形势堪忧..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "A snack, perchance?"
msgstr "一份点心，也许吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "The wait begins."
msgstr "等待开始。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It succumbed to the heat."
msgstr "它向高温屈服了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "There's no life to be had here..."
msgstr "这没有任何生命…..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "Its suffering will end soon."
msgstr "它的痛苦马上就会结束。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "It's not long for this world..."
msgstr "它不再留恋这个世界..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "It is on the precipice..."
msgstr "它在悬崖上..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "I could strip it clean, if I so chose..."
msgstr "如果我想的话，我能把它剥干净..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "It's given all it had to give."
msgstr "应该给的一切都给了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "It has crumpled under the heat."
msgstr "被热气烤的皱巴巴的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "Harbinger of doom."
msgstr "毁灭的先兆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "Balls of battle!"
msgstr "战意满满的圆球！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "Bereft of life, he rests in pieces."
msgstr "它安息了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Few of us can see our cages."
msgstr "我们中很少有人可以看到我们的笼子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "Must be hungry."
msgstr "肯定饿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "He is happier now."
msgstr "他现在更开心了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That... is an ex-bird."
msgstr "那...曾经是一只鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Dead? No. Just sleeping."
msgstr "死了？不，只是睡着了而已。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "The emptiness is eating him from the inside out."
msgstr "空虚正在吞噬它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "Sticks and silk turned lethal."
msgstr "树枝和蜘蛛丝也能变得致命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "So much hope, dashed."
msgstr "这么多的希望都化为乌有了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "No bird will ever come of it."
msgstr "它再也孵不出小鸟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "What does he pray for?"
msgstr "他在祈祷什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Ouch..."
msgstr "哎哟..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Time wins all battles."
msgstr "时间终将战胜一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "Shall we set the world on fire?"
msgstr "我们要点燃这个世界吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "To pierce the hearts of my foes..."
msgstr "刺穿我敌人的心脏..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "To burn and pierce!"
msgstr "燃烧加刺穿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "Blow in one end, pain comes out the other."
msgstr "从这一端吹气，另一端出来的是痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "Not the big sleep, just a temporary one."
msgstr "不会让目标沉睡，只会造成短暂的休眠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
msgid "Airborne lightning and death."
msgstr "空中的闪电和死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET"
msgid "A familiar, chilling embrace."
msgstr "熟悉的寒冷拥抱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM"
msgid "Blue like... er... a sad bird?"
msgstr "忧郁的蓝色，就像...呃...一只悲伤的鸟？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE"
msgid "Such an icy gaze..."
msgstr "这样一个冰冷的凝视..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON"
msgid "Whoever drew this is probably dead."
msgstr "绘制这个的人可能已经死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "I'm surprised we didn't die trying to get this."
msgstr "尝试得到这东西的时候我们居然没死，我太惊讶了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "A fungus to preserve the monotony."
msgstr "单调乏味的菌类。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "All is malleable."
msgstr "全都是有韧性的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Musty."
msgstr "一股霉臭味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "I would hide too, if I could."
msgstr "如果可以的话，我也想藏起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Harvested."
msgstr "采掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Even scarier for the trees."
msgstr "对树木来说更可怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "A shame you have to perish."
msgstr "可惜你不得不死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "Your death will be swift."
msgstr "你会死得很利索。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOAT"
msgid "It's a boat."
msgstr "一艘船。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Choking hazard."
msgstr "窒息隐患。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "You'd be surprised how much life can be gleaned from death and bones."
msgstr "你会惊讶于从死亡和骨头中可以收集多少生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "Will it teach me to fly away from here?"
msgstr "它会教我怎么飞离这里吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "The tome to end it all..."
msgstr "这本巨著会终结一切…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "I would not want such power."
msgstr "我可不想要这种力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "There is power in words."
msgstr "文字中蕴含着力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "Imagine, a rolling field of red flowers..."
msgstr "想想看，一片旋转的红玫瑰田..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Does it impart an eternal slumber?"
msgstr "它能带来永恒的长眠吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Does this world need more beasts?"
msgstr "这个世界需要更多的野兽吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "Death returns to the sender."
msgstr "死亡会回到发镖者身上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "Oh, to rid the world of fluff."
msgstr "哦，为这个世界除去无价值的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "A prison for tiny insects."
msgstr "小虫子的监狱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "I don't even remember what's within anymore..."
msgstr "我甚至都不记得里面有什么了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Abigail always helped me tie the bow."
msgstr "阿比盖尔总是帮我系蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "What tormented inner lives they must have."
msgstr "它们的内心世界一定备受折磨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It's unspeakably burnt."
msgstr "它被烧得面目全非。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "I'm already practically invisible..."
msgstr "实际上我已经是隐形的了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "I wasn't expecting that."
msgstr "我可没想到会有这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty, but short-lived."
msgstr "美丽的生命，如昙花一现。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "I hold its life in my hands."
msgstr "它的生命掌握在我的手中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "Let's see you get out of this sugary trap!"
msgstr "看你如何逃出这个甜蜜陷阱！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "No more can the butterfly soar."
msgstr "那只蝴蝶再也不能飞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "I hear they feed on the dead."
msgstr "我听说它们以死去的生物为食。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "Knives out."
msgstr "利刃出鞘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Flattened."
msgstr "成为平地了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "Even the knife-plant has a flower. Ugh."
msgstr "就连满身是刺的植物也有花。呃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "It's still dangerous."
msgstr "它还是很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Its defenses have been stripped away."
msgstr "防御被剥夺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "Darkness is looming."
msgstr "黑暗快要降临了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "I might survive this night!"
msgstr "我也许能熬过今晚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "A vision of Hell!"
msgstr "地狱般的景象！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The gloom encroaches."
msgstr "黑暗来袭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "It's a fire."
msgstr "这是一堆营火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "That is not a good sign."
msgstr "这不是个好兆头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Such a cheery yellow... I can't stand it."
msgstr "这样活泼的颜色...我忍受不了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "You're at my mercy, bird."
msgstr "你在我的摆布之中，小鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "Pestilence and death will soon claim you."
msgstr "瘟疫和死亡将会很快夺走你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "It's for putting nice things in..."
msgstr "它是用来倒入美好的东西的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "To explore to the ends of this wretched world."
msgstr "探索到这个悲惨世界的尽头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "It's a carrot."
msgstr "这是一根胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "It's a carrot that's gone through a gauntlet of fire."
msgstr "这是一根经过烈火考验的胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "It's a carrot that's in the ground."
msgstr "这是一根种在地里的胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a carrot that's waiting to be."
msgstr "这是一根等待长大的胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Well, old maps always do look burnt at the edges..."
msgstr "好吧，旧的地图边缘看起来总是像烧过一样..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "No more mapmaking, then."
msgstr "那么不再绘图了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Maps are best with monsters drawn on the borders."
msgstr "边界上或者怪物的地图是最好的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "I wonder if it had a twin, too."
msgstr "我想知道它是不是也有孪生兄弟姐妹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "All cats must die."
msgstr "所有的猫都得死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I could curl up and die in there."
msgstr "我可以卷起身子，死在那里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Nothing like the stench of death on your head."
msgstr "什么都比不上你脑袋上的死亡恶臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Call me Sisyphus."
msgstr "称呼我西西弗斯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "So close, yet so far away."
msgstr "如此贴近，却又遥不可及。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "The peels look dangerous."
msgstr "它们的皮看起来很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "The death and suffering never ends."
msgstr "死亡和苦难永无休止。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Warmed banana mush is so much better."
msgstr "热香蕉泥要美味多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "Poor plant, locked away from the sun."
msgstr "可怜的植物，永远不见天日。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "Someone is trying to keep the underground at bay."
msgstr "有人不想让别人进入地下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "There's no room at the cave party for me..."
msgstr "洞穴晚会没有容我的余地…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm too busy descending into madness to descend that cave."
msgstr "我太忙了，没时间发疯进入那个洞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "A great evil lurks beneath the surface."
msgstr "地表之下潜伏着巨大的邪恶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "Someone is trying to keep the underground at bay."
msgstr "有人不想让别人进入地下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "Oh... I guess I'm not invited to the surface party..."
msgstr "哦…我想我没有被邀请参加地面晚会…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Why leave? The light here compliments my complexion."
msgstr "为什么要离开？这里的光线显得我气色不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "The surface beckons."
msgstr "地面在召唤我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "A touch of color in the bleakness."
msgstr "晦暗中的一抹颜色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "Cold, dead and black, just like my heart."
msgstr "冰冷、死寂而黑暗，如同我的内心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "Cold, dead artificial life."
msgstr "冰冷、没有生机的人造生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "Cold, dead artificial life."
msgstr "冰冷、没有生机的人造生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "Cold, dead artificial life."
msgstr "冰冷、没有生机的人造生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "Ashes to ashes, bust to bust. Oh."
msgstr "尘归尘，土归土。哦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "A piece, constrained to the board."
msgstr "一个棋子，受制于棋盘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "They're here."
msgstr "它们在那里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "Happiness is a warm puppy... but this one is cold."
msgstr "幸福就是一只暖暖的小狗...但这一只是冷的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "It knows only fury."
msgstr "它只会发怒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "What terrible beast."
msgstr "真是可怕的野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "She now lies, cold as stone."
msgstr "她现在躺着，像石头一样冰冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "Alas, the king is but a figurehead, at best."
msgstr "哎，国王至多不过是有名无实。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "A cold mockery."
msgstr "冷淡的嘲笑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, if I could ride away into the night."
msgstr "哦，如果我可以骑走，进入夜晚之中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "They're here."
msgstr "它们在那里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE"
msgid "Such expression in her eyes."
msgstr "她的眼睛如是说。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "She holds the true power, here."
msgstr "她在这里拥有真正的力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "We are all but pawns in this game called \"life\"."
msgstr "我们在这场称为“人生”的游戏中不过是些小棋子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "A bubble, frozen in time, can never pop."
msgstr "一个冻结在时间里的泡沫，绝不会爆破。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "A mere minion to something greater."
msgstr "一个仅仅是更伟大的东西的随从。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "They're here."
msgstr "它们在那里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "A fuzzy ball of emptiness."
msgstr "一只空虚的毛球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's looking into my soul."
msgstr "它看向了我灵魂的深处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "Not so much sleeping as... waiting."
msgstr "与其说是睡眠...不如说是等待。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "My, what big teeth you have."
msgstr "天啊，你的牙齿真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Naught but a pithy imitation of life."
msgstr "只不过是粗浅地模仿活物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "To perish now would save me much sorrow."
msgstr "现在死掉就能免掉许多悲伤了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "There is no life in its eyes."
msgstr "它的眼里毫无生气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "Darkness is looming."
msgstr "黑暗快要降临了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "I might survive this night!"
msgstr "我也许能熬过今晚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "A vision of a frozen-over Hell!"
msgstr "明亮的地狱冰火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The gloom encroaches."
msgstr "黑暗来袭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "It's a weird fire."
msgstr "奇怪的火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "That is not a good sign."
msgstr "这不是个好兆头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Darkness is looming."
msgstr "黑暗快要降临了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I might survive this night!"
msgstr "我也许能熬过今晚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "A vision of a frozen-over Hell!"
msgstr "明亮的地狱冰火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The gloom encroaches."
msgstr "黑暗来袭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "It's a weird fire."
msgstr "奇怪的火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "That is not a good sign."
msgstr "这不是个好兆头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "东。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "I am directionless."
msgstr "我没有方向感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North."
msgstr "北。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast."
msgstr "东北。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest."
msgstr "西北。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "North. No wait, South."
msgstr "北。不，等等，是南。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast."
msgstr "东南。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "西南。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "Shall I even bother building this?"
msgstr "我还有必要建造它吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "It was a good death. You will be delicious."
msgstr "死得很有价值。你会很美味的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "The remaining blood has been cooked away."
msgstr "剩余的血被烤干了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Cooked evil is still evil."
msgstr "弄熟的恶魔还是恶魔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "Fire has purified it."
msgstr "火净化了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp."
msgstr "烧焦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Whatever's in there isn't dead yet."
msgstr "里面的东西还是活的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "It needs to boil."
msgstr "这需要煮煮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Finally, food."
msgstr "食物终于出炉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "As empty as my soul."
msgstr "像我的灵魂一样空虚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "It's matted, patchy and putrid."
msgstr "它乱蓬蓬地缠在一起，已经腐烂了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "I could make a corny joke, but I'll refrain."
msgstr "我可以说个关于玉米的老掉牙笑话，但我会克制的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "This corn couldn't handle the heat."
msgstr "这个玉米热得爆开了花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "The seed of life, so tiny in my hand."
msgstr "生命的种子，在我的手中如此之小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "Oh. The abyss is staring back at me..."
msgstr "哦。深渊回头盯着我..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "My, what big eyes you have."
msgstr "天啊，你的眼睛真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "Its snuggles almost make me forget."
msgstr "它的依偎几乎让我忘记了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "Cursed with nine lives. Poor thing."
msgstr "被诅咒拥有9条命。可怜的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "The softest creature in the hardest world."
msgstr "最坚硬的世界中的最柔软的生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "It's so happy."
msgstr "它很开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Blissfully unaware of mortal troubles..."
msgstr "幸福地未察觉到致命问题..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Take thy beak from out my heart!"
msgstr "把你的嘴从我的心上拔出来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "He is mine."
msgstr "他是我的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "It never even knew it was alive. How fortunate."
msgstr "它从未知道自己还活着。太幸运了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Fleeting, just like life."
msgstr "就像生命一样转瞬即逝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "The blade has sentenced you to death."
msgstr "这把剑宣告了你的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "The better to mark graves with."
msgstr "方便用来做墓碑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "This, a fitting final meal."
msgstr "这，不错的最后一餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning brightly."
msgstr "它在熊熊燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Used up and done for."
msgstr "油尽灯枯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Everything dies."
msgstr "万物皆有一死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "This tree is spooky. I bet it likes Halloween."
msgstr "这棵树很阴森。我打赌它喜欢万圣节。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "Extra-spooky!"
msgstr "超级阴森可怖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "That horn won't protect you."
msgstr "那个角保护不了你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "It lives in a constant state of fear."
msgstr "它一直生活在恐惧之中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Death incarnate!"
msgstr "死亡的化身！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "What terrors must it see."
msgstr "它肯定看到了什么可怕的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "We have grabbed life by its horn... though I wish we hadn't."
msgstr "我们已经抓住了生活的角...尽管我希望我们没抓住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "Some chains are physical..."
msgstr "有些链条是有形的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "The remains of a tuft of grass."
msgstr "一丛草的遗迹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Now no one can tell when I'm crying."
msgstr "现在没有人能够看出来我什么时候哭过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Oh look. More dirt."
msgstr "噢看看，更多的泥土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "The source is distant."
msgstr "源头在很远的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It is forever seeking its lost half."
msgstr "它永远在寻找失去的另一半。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Something wicked is here!"
msgstr "这里有邪恶的东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "The wickedness draws closer."
msgstr "邪恶逼近了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "It is very close now."
msgstr "现在已经非常接近了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "What does this newfangled thing do?"
msgstr "这个新奇玩意有什么用处？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It still needs a large key."
msgstr "它还需要一把大钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "What mysteries will be revealed!"
msgstr "会揭示什么奥妙呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "I could use that."
msgstr "我能用得上那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "The belly of the beast."
msgstr "怪物的腹部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's burning on the inside."
msgstr "它的内心在燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST"
msgid "Boom box."
msgstr "拉风的箱子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "Its teeth do not even gnash."
msgstr "它甚至没有咬牙切齿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "Pathetic."
msgstr "真可悲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "No need to lean in and check if it's hot. I can feel it from here."
msgstr "没有必要向前一步看它是否很烫。我在这里就感觉得到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "Burns hot... but not bright..."
msgstr "燃烧的温度很高...但是不明亮..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "This isn't shaped like a dragon at all."
msgstr "它的形状一点也不像龙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "Still not a dragon. At least it's dead."
msgstr "还是没有变成龙。至少它是死的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed. It won't grow a dragon."
msgstr "这是一颗种子。它不会长成一条龙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "What big eyes you have."
msgstr "你的眼睛真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "Well, at least it's a pie now."
msgstr "好吧，至少它现在做成派了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "That's just a tall tail."
msgstr "那仅仅是一条高高的尾巴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "Scales of pain."
msgstr "承载痛苦的鳞片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "Makes a good thud, and it's nutritious!"
msgstr "可以用来打鼓，而且很有营养！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Less raw, more tasty."
msgstr "烤熟点，更美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "How sad. You've no home."
msgstr "真悲催。你没有家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "How does it feel to be ripped from your home?"
msgstr "把它从你家分离出去感觉怎么样？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "I like it dead, but it should probably be returned to the earth."
msgstr "我想它死，但它可能会重返地球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "I like it dead, but it should probably be returned to the earth."
msgstr "我想它死，但它可能会重返地球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "I like it dead, but it should probably be returned to the earth."
msgstr "我想它死，但它可能会重返地球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Spiky and smelly!"
msgstr "多刺而难闻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Less spiky, but even smellier!"
msgstr "刺少了，但气味甚至更重了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "Miraculously, the seeds don't smell."
msgstr "真是奇迹，这些种子不臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Their bitter end offers protection from the bitter cold."
msgstr "它们难以接受的尾巴可以抵御严寒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "An eel."
msgstr "一条鳗鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "An eel that has been cooked."
msgstr "一条熟鳗鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "Almost a deadly nightshade. Almost."
msgstr "差一点就是致命的颠茄了。就差一点点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking this nightshade made it even less deadly."
msgstr "煮熟这个茄子可以使它不那么致命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a nightshade seed."
msgstr "这是一颗茄子种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing lasts forever."
msgstr "世上没有永恒的事物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "The shadow equivalent of taxidermy. I like it."
msgstr "阴影等同于剥制术。我喜欢它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "It's illuminating... for now."
msgstr "现在...在发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "We pulled the flowers from their homes for our own amusement."
msgstr "我们为了消遣从它们家摘了鲜花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It, too, will die."
msgstr "它也会死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "I think it's lovelier this way..."
msgstr "我想以这种方式它会更可爱..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning brightly."
msgstr "它在熊熊燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "Used up and done for."
msgstr "油尽灯枯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "Everything dies."
msgstr "万物皆有一死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nature is so boring."
msgstr "大自然真是无聊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning brightly."
msgstr "它在熊熊燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "Used up and done for."
msgstr "油尽灯枯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Everything dies."
msgstr "万物皆有一死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Its cycle of life is ending."
msgstr "它的生命循环结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "That's one stretchy eye."
msgstr "这是一个可展开的眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "They follow their master's every wish."
msgstr "它们对主人言听必从。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "I do not know why it helps me."
msgstr "我不知道它为什么帮我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "I think it needs to be placed."
msgstr "我想它需要放好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "This earth is burnt and dead."
msgstr "这块土地已经被烧毁，失去了生命力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "What seeds shall I sow?"
msgstr "我该种什么种子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Leafy tendrils coil out of the muck."
msgstr "枝繁叶茂的卷须盘绕在泥土上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "This earth is cold and dead."
msgstr "这块土地冰凉而没有生机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "That'll make quite a draft."
msgstr "它可以扇起不小的风。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "Ca-caw!"
msgstr "嚓嚓！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "M...maybe I'll doodle something... When no one's looking."
msgstr "嗯...也许我会涂鸦点东西...趁没人在看的时候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "A canary feather, golden as the gilded cage."
msgstr "一根金丝雀的羽毛，像镀金的笼子一样闪亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "A crow feather, black like eternal darkness."
msgstr "乌鸦羽毛，像永夜一样漆黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "A redbird feather, red like blood."
msgstr "红雀羽毛，鲜红似血。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "A snowbird feather, white as the light at the end of the tunnel."
msgstr "雪雀的羽毛，就像隧道尽头的光一样白。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "I wonder what she did."
msgstr "我想知道她干了什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "Sort of like an emotional barrier. But wood."
msgstr "有点像情感障碍。但是是木头的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "Will it keep others in, or out?"
msgstr "它会把别人困在里面，或是外面吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "We could use it to build a gate."
msgstr "我们可以用它来建造一个大门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "We could use it to build a fence."
msgstr "我们可以用它来建造一个栅栏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket of grime."
msgstr "一桶肥料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "To call death from the skies."
msgstr "召唤死亡从天而降。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "It needs only a light."
msgstr "它只是需要一点亮光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "A tiny brightness in the dark."
msgstr "黑暗中的微光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "Tiny lights, stranded from the world outside my pocket."
msgstr "从我的口袋洒向外界的微光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "His disposition is fiery."
msgstr "他的性情暴躁如火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Don't give up, little flame!"
msgstr "别放弃，小火苗！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A flame to keep the horrors at bay."
msgstr "防止暗影怪靠近的火焰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "This fire burns with passion!"
msgstr "这团火焰热烈地燃烧着！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "It's losing the will to go on."
msgstr "它失去了继续下去的意志。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "It's a comfort."
msgstr "它给人安慰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "This can be rekindled, unlike my heart."
msgstr "这可以复燃，不像我的心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "The world will burn before this staff."
msgstr "世界将在这根魔杖面前燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "It's running on fumes."
msgstr "燃料快用完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "Quiet as a corpse."
msgstr "像尸体一样安静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "I don't know why you bother. We're all going to burn."
msgstr "我不知道你为什么要理会。我们最终都会被烧掉的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "It was flopping around desperately for life. The poor fool."
msgstr "它为了活命绝望地挣扎。可怜的傻瓜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "With this the fishies will be ripped from the safety of their precious pond."
msgstr "有了这个，可以把小鱼从珍贵的池塘分离开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Perfectly molded blocks of fish."
msgstr "精心打造的鱼肉块。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Hopefully no bones still linger within."
msgstr "希望体内没有骨头存在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "A proper grilling puts a stop to the flopping."
msgstr "烤上一会儿，它们就不会扑腾了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "A tiny blade-like rock."
msgstr "一个刀刃状的小石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "They are bright and cheery. Yuck."
msgstr "它们明亮又活泼。真讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Prickly and blood red..."
msgstr "敏感和血红色…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "But I am in mourning..."
msgstr "但我正在哀悼..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Ugh, more flowers."
msgstr "啊，更多的花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "It looks fragile."
msgstr "它看起来很脆弱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "At least they're better than the other flowers."
msgstr "至少比别的花要好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "This is the fate of all things."
msgstr "这是所有事物的命运。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Lead me to the Aarnivalkea."
msgstr "它在迷惑我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "A dead thing for me to wear. Goody."
msgstr "我可以把这个死去的东西戴在头上。太好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "It is death, preserved."
msgstr "它是死亡，维持的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "What horrors have we resurrected here today?"
msgstr "我们今天复活了什么令人恐怖的东西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Death has a sense of humor."
msgstr "死亡有一种幽默感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "We must find more pieces."
msgstr "我们必须找到更多的碎块。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Life is small and short."
msgstr "生命渺小而短暂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "He's little and warty."
msgstr "他个子很小而且全身是包。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "He's asleep."
msgstr "他睡着了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "I never thought frog's legs could look so good."
msgstr "我从没想过蛙腿可以看上去这么棒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "Torn right from the frog."
msgstr "它是从青蛙身上扯下来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Definitely not twitching any longer."
msgstr "肯定不会再抽筋了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "Sweet, tart and in a cup."
msgstr "装在杯子里，酸酸甜甜的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "This came from a living creature."
msgstr "这东西来自活的生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "A \"puppy\", frozen in time..."
msgstr "一只“小狗”，冻结在时间里..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "I can make that face too..."
msgstr "我也会做那个鬼脸..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "The insides of a mechanical demon."
msgstr "机械恶魔的内心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "It looks so empty."
msgstr "它看上去如此空虚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "The gem has focused it."
msgstr "宝石让能量聚集了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "He has risen from the grave!"
msgstr "他从坟墓里跑出来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "The only gift I desire is a swift end..."
msgstr "我唯一想要的礼物是尽快结束..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Abby... how do I make the ribbon curly?"
msgstr "艾比...我怎么才能把缎带弄弯曲？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "A moment frozen in time."
msgstr "时光凝结的瞬间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "My warped reflection stares back at me with malice."
msgstr "我弯曲的倒影带着恶意回视着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER"
msgid "Well aren't you a happy little fuzzball. Die."
msgstr "难道你不是一个快乐的小毛毛球？死的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "Even flowers of the night die."
msgstr "即使是夜之花也会死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Flower of the night."
msgstr "夜之花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Fuzzball excrement."
msgstr "毛毛球的排泄物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "Even his wings are small and cheery."
msgstr "就连他的翅膀也是小小而活泼的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "I think it's curdled."
msgstr "我认为它凝固了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "They're just for show."
msgstr "他们只是徒有其表。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "One might as well kill trees with style."
msgstr "谁都可以有范地把树杀掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "One might as well smash rocks with style."
msgstr "谁都可以有范地击碎岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "One might as well till fields with style."
msgstr "谁都可以有范地耕田。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "One might as well can dig with style."
msgstr "谁都可以有范地掘地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Even in purgatory it remains the most precious of metals."
msgstr "即使在炼狱之中，它仍是最珍贵的金属。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Plucked, just like Abigail was from me."
msgstr "一片落羽，就像阿比盖尔离开我一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It needs poop."
msgstr "它需要施肥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "It smells funny."
msgstr "闻起来怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's not long for this world..."
msgstr "它不再留恋这个世界..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "It is on the precipice..."
msgstr "它在悬崖上..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just a tuft of grass."
msgstr "这只是一丛草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "It has been killed."
msgstr "它被杀死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "It just couldn't take the heat."
msgstr "它无法承受这样的高温。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It's suffering."
msgstr "它在受苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "This is a creature ruled by fear."
msgstr "这是一个被恐惧左右的生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "The sun beats down."
msgstr "阳光太猛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "A flash of brilliance!"
msgstr "才华的闪光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "The flaws are its most beautiful features."
msgstr "瑕疵是它最美丽的特质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "A green aura hangs over us..."
msgstr "一个绿色的光环笼罩在我们上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "I can see the power sparkling deep within."
msgstr "我能看见其中深藏的能量火花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "This mushroom is disappointingly normal."
msgstr "这个蘑菇太普通了，真让人失望。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "All is malleable."
msgstr "全都是有韧性的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Dank."
msgstr "它又湿又冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "I would hide too, if I could."
msgstr "如果可以的话，我也想藏起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Harvested."
msgstr "采掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "That's just gruesome. I like it."
msgstr "很可怕，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "The inevitable byproduct of life."
msgstr "这是生命不可避免的副产品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "It is a dark path we tread."
msgstr "这是一条我们踏上的黑暗之路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Oh... it's... g-good."
msgstr "哦...它很...好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "This is... fun..."
msgstr "这很...有趣..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "You have to bite their heads off first... heehee..."
msgstr "你首先必须把它们的脑袋咬下来...嘻嘻..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Today I eat them. One day, they'll eat me."
msgstr "今天我吃掉它们，有一天它们会吃掉我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "A candy as hard as my heart."
msgstr "和我的心一样硬的糖果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "What is this eternal burning?!"
msgstr "是什么烧个没完？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "The most delicious lie."
msgstr "最美味的谎言。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Sigh. At least it's honest."
msgstr "叹气。至少它是诚实的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Don't worry, Webber, it's just candy."
msgstr "不要担心，韦伯，它只是糖果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "Nine lives are not enough to save you from my hungry maw..."
msgstr "九条命不够从我饥饿的大嘴里救下你..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "Lumps of bitter sorrow."
msgstr "大团的剧烈的痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Life is a swirling abyss of suffering and disappointment."
msgstr "生活就是充满痛苦和失望的打着旋涡的深渊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "This is... fun..."
msgstr "这很...有趣..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "As perplexing as it is delicious."
msgstr "它又复杂又美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Things seem less horrifying with this."
msgstr "有了它，很多东西就显得不那么恐怖了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "If only life was so potent."
msgstr "如果生命也这么强大就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Like life, it's a bit disappointing."
msgstr "它就像生命一样有点令人失望。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "I wish I possessed such burning within my heart."
msgstr "我真希望我心里也燃烧着这样的火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "It reminds me of Abigail. I'll hang it somewhere."
msgstr "它让我想起阿比盖尔。我要把它挂在某个地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "It longs to be hung somewhere."
msgstr "它渴望被挂在某个地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "Decoration for a devilish day."
msgstr "邪恶日子的装饰物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "A memorial for a monster."
msgstr "恶魔纪念品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "It descends into darkness."
msgstr "它陷入黑暗了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "Crows in trees mean souls trapped between worlds."
msgstr "树上的乌鸦代表困在不同世界之间的灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "Death begets death."
msgstr "用死亡制造死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "This hammer does not create... it only destroys..."
msgstr "锤子不能创造...它只用于毁灭..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "What a brutal implement."
msgstr "多么残暴的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "They'll put flowers on anything these days."
msgstr "如今，他们做什么都要在上面放点花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Life brings pain, pain brings life."
msgstr "生命带来痛苦，痛苦带来生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I could restore my allies."
msgstr "我能让我的盟友复活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "Just a moderately cold lump of rock."
msgstr "只是一块有些冰凉的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Frozen like my heart."
msgstr "像我的心一样冰冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "There it sits, just taking up space."
msgstr "它待在那里，占据着空间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "Those that burn brightest, burn fastest."
msgstr "烧得最亮的也会最快烧尽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "As lukewarm and lifeless as every other rock."
msgstr "像其他石头一样微温而没有生机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "What dark machinations were once concocted beneath?"
msgstr "下面曾经策划了什么黑暗的阴谋诡计？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "A pathetic simulacrum..."
msgstr "一个可悲的幻象..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Transient, indeed."
msgstr "的确是暂时的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "A mark is made, however transient."
msgstr "我做了个标记，不过是暂时的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "Its blank face shall soon offer a secret."
msgstr "它一脸茫然，很快便会透露秘密。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "A sweet, but fleeting treat."
msgstr "甜蜜而短暂的一餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Pieces of beehive, scattered."
msgstr "散乱的蜂窝碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "A sweet sauce for this creature's sweet embrace."
msgstr "死去的肉块，蘸满甜蜜的酱汁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Meat cut into tiny pieces. Just like my heart."
msgstr "把肉切成小块。就像我的心一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "It sounds like there's a beefalo trapped inside."
msgstr "听起来里面似乎困着一头牦牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Abigail hated spicy foods."
msgstr "阿比盖尔讨厌吃辣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "Stay back, foul minion of evil!"
msgstr "退后，恶魔的肮脏手下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "The remains of an evil beast."
msgstr "邪恶野兽的遗骨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Home to the foulest creatures."
msgstr "最邪恶的生物的巢穴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Pulled out by the root."
msgstr "连根拔起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "That I cannot hear it does not mean it is silent."
msgstr "我听不见它的声音，不代表它很安静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "He is blissfully ignorant."
msgstr "他无忧无虑，并不知情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's not floating, yet."
msgstr "还没浮起来呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "It's reached its natural state."
msgstr "它已达到其自然状态。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Broken pieces of my heart."
msgstr "我心灵的碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It is as cold as my heart."
msgstr "像我的心一样冰冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Ice cream could never replace Abigail."
msgstr "冰淇淋绝不能代替阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Keep a cool head."
msgstr "保持冷静的头脑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "He has a cold, dead heart."
msgstr "他有一颗冰冷、死寂的心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Nothing can insulate us from the horrors of this world."
msgstr "任何东西都隔绝不了世间惨事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "A staff to freeze."
msgstr "有冰冻效果的魔杖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "It's calling my name."
msgstr "它在呼唤我的名字。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It's cold and black."
msgstr "它乌黑冰冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "When I look in the mirror, it's like Abigail's here."
msgstr "当我照镜子时，犹如看到阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "The perfect amount of jam."
msgstr "份量很完美的果酱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "Beans that shall never know life."
msgstr "不会理解生活的豌豆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Meat, skewered right through the center."
msgstr "从中间串起来的肉串。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "A bee without conscience."
msgstr "一只没有良知的蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "Be still, little one."
msgstr "别乱动，小家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "I see him when I'm sleeping..."
msgstr "我在睡觉的时候看见了他..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "The key to our prosperity..."
msgstr "通向繁荣的钥匙..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "Should we peek inside...?"
msgstr "我们应该往里面瞧瞧吗...？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "A cold, soulless horse."
msgstr "一匹冰冷的、没有灵魂的马。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Another battle lost to time."
msgstr "另一场输给时间的战斗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "A beast of solitude."
msgstr "一只孤独的野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "It stands against the cruel elements."
msgstr "它抵抗着残酷的天气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "Hello, foul creature of the underworld."
msgstr "你好啊，地下的邪恶生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It smells of goat."
msgstr "闻起来一股羊膻味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "Light the way, darkly."
msgstr "昏暗地照出前方的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "This world is nothing but hurt."
msgstr "这个世界充满伤害。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "Heavy protection for one's heart."
msgstr "大力保护心脏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "If only my heart were as light."
msgstr "如果我的心也这么轻就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "They'll have to catch me to hurt me."
msgstr "他们要想伤害我就得先抓到我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "Protect my fragile frame."
msgstr "保护我脆弱的身躯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "Even our armor is fanged."
msgstr "就连我们的盔甲也带有尖牙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "It will restore one's power."
msgstr "它能恢复某人的力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "It protects from damage, but not from sorrow."
msgstr "它能抵挡伤害，但不能抵挡悲伤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "That Battle Standard needs to be destroyed..."
msgstr "需要摧毁那面战斗旗帜..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "How do you do, Bernie?"
msgstr "你好吗，伯尼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "A ruthless man."
msgstr "一个无情的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I forsee a wave of death."
msgstr "我预见会有一波死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "When will you be free from this torment?"
msgstr "你什么时候才能脱离这种痛苦呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "There is dastardly power within."
msgstr "里面蕴含着邪恶力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "But what of the birds?"
msgstr "可是鸟儿怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "A bombardment of pain."
msgstr "痛苦的轰炸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "It eases pain of the body, but not of the heart."
msgstr "它能减轻肉体的痛苦，但不能减轻心灵的痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "But will it heal my soul?"
msgstr "但是它能治愈我的灵魂吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "It's too heavy. Like my soul."
msgstr "它太沉重了。就像我的灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "Empty as my heart."
msgstr "像我的心一样空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Full as my sorrows."
msgstr "像我的悲伤一样满。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "It brings more pain into the world."
msgstr "它给世界带来了更多痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Hello again, Lucy."
msgstr "你好啊，露西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I dared not hope it would take me home."
msgstr "我不敢奢望它能送我回家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "I bid you good day."
msgstr "祝你度过愉快的一天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "I'll be able to attack so often..."
msgstr "我可以很频繁地攻击..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "That's where they come from..."
msgstr "他们就是从这里来的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Hit harder, stronger..."
msgstr "攻击得更猛烈..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "The wearer shall be a force of good."
msgstr "戴上它，就会拥有正义的力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "It burns with the fires of Hell."
msgstr "它燃烧着地狱的火焰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "Cold-blooded."
msgstr "冷血。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it worth it to put stake in your future?"
msgstr "值得拿你的未来冒险吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "This egg is almost as cold as my heart."
msgstr "这个蛋几乎像我的心一样冰冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "The egg is warm, but my heart is still cold."
msgstr "蛋暖和了，但我的心还是冰冷的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "Enjoy your happiness while it lasts, little lavae."
msgstr "人生苦短，尽情享受你短暂的快乐吧，小岩浆虫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "A spark of life illuminating the darkness."
msgstr "照亮黑暗的生命火花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "He is suffering the pangs of hunger."
msgstr "它正在承受饥饿之痛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "He is approaching death."
msgstr "它正在走向死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "Forsooth, it's a tooth."
msgstr "确实，这是一颗牙齿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cooled off and smells funny."
msgstr "它凉下来了，气味很古怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "It spit up."
msgstr "它在喷火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "I could jump in and be done."
msgstr "我可以跳进去，一了百了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "It's... a rock... Sigh."
msgstr "它是...一块岩石...叹气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "A lumbering beast."
msgstr "一只动作迟缓的野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "A lumbering beast."
msgstr "一只动作迟缓的野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "How does it manage to grow like that?"
msgstr "它是怎么长成那样的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "We were not meant to cheat death."
msgstr "我们不是想逃脱死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "It's slowly burning out."
msgstr "它在慢慢燃尽光亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Death in a box..."
msgstr "进退维谷…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Chaaaarge!"
msgstr "充电！！！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Look at those hooves."
msgstr "看看这些长蹄子的动物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "A weird curling horn."
msgstr "奇怪的弯曲羊角。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Even this power will run out."
msgstr "即使是这样的力量也会耗尽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Focuses the destruction."
msgstr "将毁灭的力量聚集于一处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "The cycle of violence continues."
msgstr "暴力周而复始，仍在继续。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "It is forever screaming silently."
msgstr "它永远在无声地尖叫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Can it never die?"
msgstr "它会长生不死吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Potential horror."
msgstr "潜在的恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "It'll grow up big and abhorrent."
msgstr "它会长大，然后变得令人憎恶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "Just a burning log."
msgstr "一根燃烧着的木头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "If trees could talk, they would scream at the sight of this."
msgstr "如果树可以说话，看到这个会让它们尖叫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Luck has long since abandoned me..."
msgstr "运气已经抛弃我很久了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "Hello... \"Lucy\"... I'd like you to meet my sister."
msgstr "哈喽…..“露西”….我想让你见见我姐姐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "This life appeared from nowhere."
msgstr "这条生命来自不知名的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "It consumes all."
msgstr "它吞食万物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Life goes on."
msgstr "生命在继续。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "Madness lies within."
msgstr "里面充满疯狂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "I wonder what he did."
msgstr "我想知道他干了什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Alas, poor mandrake!"
msgstr "唉，可怜的曼德拉草！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "Boiled the life out of him."
msgstr "他被煮死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Onward, vegetable minion!"
msgstr "前进，蔬菜部下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Now it's just food."
msgstr "现在它只是食物了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "The mighty mandrake. It's best picked at night."
msgstr "威力无比的曼德拉草。最好是在晚上采摘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "It contains his fuzzy wuzzy essence."
msgstr "毛茸茸、软绵绵的，尽显其本质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "Blank as Abigail now."
msgstr "现在像阿比盖尔一样空白。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "Smooth and lifeless."
msgstr "光滑而没有生机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "Cold... but not lifeless..."
msgstr "寒冷...但不是死气沉沉..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "It cares nothing for the laws of this world..."
msgstr "它丝毫不顾这个世界的规律..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "Even stone can not withstand the constant pull of decay."
msgstr "即使是石头，也经不起天长地久的腐蚀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "Against all odds, it has flourished in life..."
msgstr "困难重重，它还是在生命中茂盛起来..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "Be ye alive or be ye dead?"
msgstr "生存还是死亡？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Even thorns burn."
msgstr "就连刺木也会燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "A bush that always hurts."
msgstr "总是能造成伤痛的灌木丛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Life is pain. Now it has no life."
msgstr "生命是一种痛苦。现在，它没有了生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "It's a plant."
msgstr "这是一株植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning."
msgstr "它在燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Black like my heart."
msgstr "像我的心一样黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Its spikes were no protection."
msgstr "它的针叶没能保护它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A tree that knows only pain."
msgstr "一棵只能感受到痛苦的树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "I feel a strange kinship with him."
msgstr "他让我觉得有一种奇怪的亲切感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "He sure has a taste for the dramatic."
msgstr "他确实对戏剧有品味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "What a curious light."
msgstr "多么奇妙的光芒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "Looks magical."
msgstr "看起来充满魔力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Shall we have a danse macabre?"
msgstr "我们要跳一场死亡之舞吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "Not quite what I expected."
msgstr "跟我期望的不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "It is still bloody."
msgstr "依旧血腥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "Balled meat. How exciting."
msgstr "肉丸。太让人兴奋了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "It's done drying. Forever."
msgstr "它晾肉的日子永远结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "The drying is over."
msgstr "肉晾好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "It sways in the drying wind."
msgstr "它在干燥的风中晃来晃去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "The rain is keeping it from drying."
msgstr "雨水让它没那么容易晾干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "I can hang meat here."
msgstr "我可以把肉挂在这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Meat turned dry and delicious."
msgstr "肉晾干了，很美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "Horrid swamp thing!"
msgstr "可怕的沼泽怪物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Somehow, it found a way to sink even lower."
msgstr "不论怎样，它找到了更加沉沦的方式。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "No dignity at all."
msgstr "一点尊严都没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Fire has broken it down even further."
msgstr "火的洗礼让它更加残破了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Time has broken it down."
msgstr "时间的洗礼让它破旧不堪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "Hands-free lighting!"
msgstr "解放双手的照明工具！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "When I am still, it is as lifeless as Abigail."
msgstr "我静止不动的时候，它就像阿比盖尔一样死气沉沉的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Such a striking likeness..."
msgstr "惊人的相似..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "It is bare..."
msgstr "它光秃秃..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "We must stick it in the cold, hard ground..."
msgstr "我们必须把它刺进寒冷坚硬的土地里..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "He must be lonely, trapped in such a small cage."
msgstr "被困在这样一个小小的牢笼中，他肯定很孤独。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "My, what magnificent horns you have!"
msgstr "天啊，你有一对多么华丽的角！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "All that remains of a once great beast."
msgstr "一位曾经的伟大野兽留下的全部遗物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "You should go back to where it's dark."
msgstr "你应该回到黑暗的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "How do you like being torn away from your family?"
msgstr "被迫和你的家人分离是什么滋味呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Stay down there, away from this horrible place."
msgstr "待在下面，远离这个恐怖的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "So this is what those things see."
msgstr "这就是那些生物看到的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "Down, down, down to the depths."
msgstr "往下、往下、往下，一直挖到土地深处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Living without the burden of intelligence must be nice."
msgstr "不用动脑地活着肯定很爽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "It's filthy."
msgstr "真脏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "Cooked evil is still evil. Even in lasagna."
msgstr "弄熟的恶魔还是恶魔，在千层饼中也不会改变。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Evilness pervades it."
msgstr "邪恶在里面蔓延。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Meat turned dry and weird-tasting."
msgstr "肉晾干了，味道有点怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "It's been ravaged by time."
msgstr "我受到了时间的蹂躏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I felt a terrible chill run down my spine."
msgstr "我感觉一股可怕的寒意顺着我的脊椎下去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "Bathed in pale eternal light..."
msgstr "沐浴在苍白的永恒的亮光中..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Perhaps it thirsts for a sacrifice. Where's Webber..."
msgstr "也许它是渴望祭品。韦伯在哪里..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "That doesn't look right..."
msgstr "那看起来不对..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "Caves. The moon's one weakness."
msgstr "洞穴。月亮的一个弱点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Does it reflect from the other side too, Abigail?"
msgstr "它从另一边也会反射吗，阿比盖尔？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "A full moon looms overhead. Watchful."
msgstr "一轮满月在地面上时隐时现。小心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "A new moon looms above us."
msgstr "一轮新月在我们上面时隐时现。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon is on the wane."
msgstr "月亮正在亏缺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon waxes before us."
msgstr "月亮在我们面前越来越圆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "It's useless and missing a piece, much like me."
msgstr "它没有用，还缺了一块，就像我一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "A lifeless sacrifice."
msgstr "死气沉沉的供品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "It's traveled so far..."
msgstr "它跨越了遥不可及的距离..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "Its pallor reminds me of Abigail."
msgstr "它的苍白让我想起了阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "Now it will never decay..."
msgstr "现在它永远不会腐败..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "It's an abomination."
msgstr "它很可憎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "Not sure how a thing like that happens."
msgstr "不确定那样的事情是怎么发生的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "A cradle of life. I hate it."
msgstr "生命的摇篮。我恨它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "It thieves others' life to maintain its own."
msgstr "它窃取他人的生命来维持自己的生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "I can feel its stolen warmth."
msgstr "我能感觉到它偷来的鲜血的温热。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "A sack of blood ripped from a mosquito. I love it."
msgstr "从蚊子身上掉落下来的血囊。我爱这玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "A new life. The last thing anyone needs."
msgstr "一个新生命。没人需要这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "The earth has vomited up its secrets."
msgstr "大地吐露了它的秘密。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Some day, I will join you."
msgstr "总有一天，我会加入你们的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "Its beauty is tinged with a heartbreaking sadness."
msgstr "它的美丽略带令人心碎的悲伤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Cold and beautiful like death."
msgstr "冰冷而美丽，就像死亡一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "An item with multiple uses."
msgstr "一个用途多多的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "Death in mushroom form."
msgstr "蘑菇形式的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "If I'm lucky, it'll be poisonous."
msgstr "如果我足够幸运，它会是有毒的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "Death has released it."
msgstr "死亡已经解放它了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A death cap, surely."
msgstr "当然是一顶死亡帽子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "It is no more."
msgstr "它不存在了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "Emptiness. The natural state of all things."
msgstr "虚无。所有事物的自然状态。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "It thrives... against all odds..."
msgstr "尽管困难重重...它还是茁壮成长..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "Nothing escapes the pull of decay."
msgstr "没有什么逃得掉衰败的拉扯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "A frigid cold bites at its heart."
msgstr "严寒咬了一口它的心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "The beginnings of life..."
msgstr "生命的开始..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Completely teeming with life..."
msgstr "完全充满了生机..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Life goes on."
msgstr "生命在继续。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Oh look... A mushroom..."
msgstr "哦看...一个蘑菇..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Abigail would have thought this was... pretty..."
msgstr "阿比盖尔会认为这东西...很可爱..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing good may last."
msgstr "好的东西不可能会持续。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "Let's turn it red as my heart's blood..."
msgstr "我们把它变得和我的心脏的血一样红吧..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "Such a sickly fungal glow..."
msgstr "这样一个脆弱的真菌发光了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "All its efforts fall on rocky soil."
msgstr "它的所有努力都掉落在多石的土壤上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like a rotting hat."
msgstr "它看起来像一顶腐烂的帽子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "It has a glowing presence."
msgstr "它有着鲜艳的外表。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Do little gnomes live in these?"
msgstr "有小地精生活在这里吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "It's trying so hard. Why?"
msgstr "它这么努力地尝试，为什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "These are some strange trees."
msgstr "这是一些奇怪的树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED"
msgid "This one is frail and scorned. Like a friend."
msgstr "这一棵虚弱而卑微，像一个朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "Eerie, and yet beautiful."
msgstr "怪异但美丽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "With the sleep of dreams comes this stuff."
msgstr "这东西随着睡梦而来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "It pulls power from beneath."
msgstr "它从地下汲取能量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "I know not what lurks in the shadow."
msgstr "我不知道阴影中潜伏着什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "It's almost over."
msgstr "快要结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "The presence has departed."
msgstr "那东西离开了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "They're all around!"
msgstr "它们就在身边！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "I think they're leaving."
msgstr "我想它们应该正在离去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "I can feel the prying eyes."
msgstr "我可以感觉到虎视眈眈的眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "They approach."
msgstr "它们接近了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Danger in the dark."
msgstr "黑暗中的危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Dreams come to a point. A sharp one."
msgstr "噩梦渐渐变得尖锐，铸成了这把利剑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "Herein lies the folly of man."
msgstr "这是人类的愚蠢带来的产物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE"
msgid "A place to drown my sorrows."
msgstr "淹没我的伤心事的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I used to take joy in instruments such as these."
msgstr "我曾经在类似的乐器中享受这样的快乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "I see a million sad eyes reflecting back at me..."
msgstr "我看见一百万只悲伤的眼睛反射在我身上..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "As cold and lifeless as... well..."
msgstr "又冷，又死气沉沉..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "Temporary release from drudgery."
msgstr "临时从苦差中解脱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "Such things used to bring me happiness."
msgstr "这些东西过去曾给我带来快乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "It sees all, and yet nothing."
msgstr "它什么都看见了，但是什么都看不见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "With each use the wielder dies and is again reborn."
msgstr "每用一次，使用者会死掉，然后又重生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Life is a gamble."
msgstr "生活是一场赌博。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Music is the window to my empty soul."
msgstr "音乐是通向我空虚灵魂的窗户。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "For documenting my pain."
msgstr "用于记录我的痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "Abigail will defend me."
msgstr "阿比盖尔会护着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "All dressed up, but where to go?"
msgstr "全都衣冠楚楚，但是去哪呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Dumb bird! Stay away from the berries!"
msgstr "笨鸟！离浆果远点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's... surprisingly soft."
msgstr "它...出奇地柔软。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Black like my heart."
msgstr "像我的心一样黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's empty..."
msgstr "它是空的..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It hungers for a sacrifice."
msgstr "它渴望祭品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "A lovely little pouch of nutrients."
msgstr "小巧可爱的营养饺子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Its joy was so disparaging..."
msgstr "它的快乐如此受轻视…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "They are painted with the colors of my soul."
msgstr "它们用我的灵魂着色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Now it will never die..."
msgstr "现在它会长生不死..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "The wretched beast must have been sick."
msgstr "那只不幸的野兽肯定是生病了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "That the earth itself might be penetrated."
msgstr "那地球本身可能会被穿透。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "A storm rages within him."
msgstr "暴风雨在他体内肆虐着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "Furious."
msgstr "怒不可遏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "His whole career is grounded in violence."
msgstr "他的整个职业生涯都以暴力为基础。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Petrifying."
msgstr "石化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "This little piggie looks mean."
msgstr "这头小猪看上去脾气不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "They are more useful in death."
msgstr "它们在死后更有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "He's been burnt down."
msgstr "他被烧焦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "Kill the pig! Spill his blood!"
msgstr "杀了这只猪，沥干他的血！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing lasts forever."
msgstr "世上没有永恒的事物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "I hope they're enjoying themselves."
msgstr "我希望他们过得快活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "At least they are comfortable."
msgstr "至少这些屋子很舒适。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Always on the outside, looking in."
msgstr "总是在外面，看里面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Live it up while you can, Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下，尽您所能逍遥快活吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "He's better off, now."
msgstr "他现在日子更好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "I still feel alone."
msgstr "我还是觉得孤单。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "They are so standoffish."
msgstr "他们真不友好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "How Orwellian."
msgstr "真是奥威尔式的做派。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "A creature of the night!"
msgstr "夜行生物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Ashes to ashes."
msgstr "尘归尘，土归土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It needs a sacrifice of flesh."
msgstr "它需要祭肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A tribute to gluttony."
msgstr "向暴食者致敬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "The hide of a pig that once was."
msgstr "曾经是一只猪身上的皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "The place where they wrap pigs in blankets."
msgstr "他们把猪裹进毯子里的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "It cuts at the darkness."
msgstr "它驱散了黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "Yet another unnecessary plaything."
msgstr "又是一个不必要的玩物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "A tiny life, ensconced in brittle death."
msgstr "藏身于脆弱死亡中的渺小生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "A tree will grow soon."
msgstr "一棵树很快就会长出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "What a devilish tool!"
msgstr "多么邪恶的工具！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "It has a foul smell."
msgstr "它的气味很难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It's only slightly more appealing."
msgstr "烹饪过后味道只好了一点点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "An edible plant."
msgstr "一株可食用的植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Keep growing. I'll wait."
msgstr "继续生长吧。我会等着的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "It is ready for the harvest."
msgstr "可以收获了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's had the life sucked out of it."
msgstr "它的生命被抽空了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s... they'll betray us."
msgstr "%s…他们会背叛我们的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Do you wish to see the world burn?"
msgstr "你想看到这个世界燃烧吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "你好吗，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "A heart could return %s to this world..."
msgstr "一颗心便能帮助 %s 回到这个世界…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Cutthroat!"
msgstr "谋杀者！杀人凶手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "Abigail likes you, %s."
msgstr "%s，阿比盖尔喜欢你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "So many juicy red bits to chomp and squish!"
msgstr "这么多可以咬碎挤扁的多汁红色果肉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Warm, but no less messy."
msgstr "变热了，但还是那么麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "I was expecting more seeds than this from that thing."
msgstr "我原本期望那东西能多产点种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "Ophelia? Are you down there?"
msgstr "奥菲莉娅，你在下面吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "Some algae."
msgstr "一些水藻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Life is blood and this."
msgstr "生命的特征就是血和这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "Its growth is stunted by the limits of the pot."
msgstr "花盆限制了它的生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I would have to be desperate."
msgstr "我要不是饿疯了绝不会吃它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "It's as big as the hole where my heart once was."
msgstr "它和我心里曾经的洞一样大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Why indulge in such childish things?"
msgstr "为什么沉迷于这种孩子把戏？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "It shriveled a tiny bit from the heat. I like that."
msgstr "热量让它萎缩了一点点。我喜欢这样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "You're not so scary."
msgstr "你并没有那么吓人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed. Exciting."
msgstr "这是一颗种子。真令人兴奋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "It's oozing."
msgstr "正在渗出怪影。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Purple like a... purple thing."
msgstr "紫得就像一个...紫色的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "Maybe now I'll lose fewer friends..."
msgstr "也许现在我会失去更少的朋友..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "We have prolonged our horrific demise."
msgstr "我们可以晚点走上最后的结局了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "The monster's hunger shall never cease."
msgstr "那头怪兽的饥饿是永不终止的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "A post. Not very exciting."
msgstr "一根柱子而已，没什么大惊小怪的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Like death, it creeps everywhere."
msgstr "就像死神一样，它到处爬行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "I am not impressed by opulence."
msgstr "我对珠光宝气不感冒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "What horror have those eyes witnessed?"
msgstr "这些眼睛见证过怎样的恐怖情景呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Yet another reminder of death."
msgstr "死亡的又一个象征。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Don't worry. You'll be dead soon."
msgstr "别担心，你会死得很快的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "It shall never grow another berry."
msgstr "一个浆果也长不出了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "It is empty, like my heart."
msgstr "空空如也，就像我的内心一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "For making food."
msgstr "用于制作食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "For making a small amount of food."
msgstr "用于制作少量食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "I shall put them on my eyes when I die."
msgstr "我要在临死前把它放在我的眼睛上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "Money will not bring back Abigail."
msgstr "有钱也无法让我的阿比盖尔复活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "Wealth cannot buy immortality."
msgstr "财富买不到永生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "It came from above."
msgstr "从天而降。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "Its insides are as horrid as its outsides."
msgstr "无论内外，它都是可怕的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It's ready now."
msgstr "它现在煮熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "Life is a trap."
msgstr "生活是个陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "Wilson calls them \"greens\"... but they're purple..."
msgstr "威尔逊称它们为“绿蔬”，但它们是紫色的呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "Flour by any other name would smell as sweet."
msgstr "即使换一个名称，面粉依然会是香气四溢的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked purples."
msgstr "煮熟的紫蔬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "We should offer it to the beast."
msgstr "我们应当把它献祭给野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "The beast will be satisfied with this."
msgstr "对此，野兽会感到满意的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "This will satisfy the beast, but not for long."
msgstr "这会满足野兽的，但不会长久。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "The beast doesn't want that."
msgstr "它不是野兽想要的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "A waste."
msgstr "浪费了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "It gives food flavor."
msgstr "它给食物增添风味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "It smells a bit nice."
msgstr "它有点好闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID"
msgid "What childhood is this for you?"
msgstr "你这是怎么样的童年啊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
msgid "But no honey."
msgstr "但没有蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM"
msgid "Hello, ma'am. Care to trade?"
msgstr "您好，女士。要不要做个交易？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL"
msgid "It can't make life more palatable."
msgstr "它并不能让我的生活变得美好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM"
msgid "I don't want to carry this around."
msgstr "我不想到处带着它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL"
msgid "It makes a little bit of food."
msgstr "可以用它制作少许食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM"
msgid "It only works if I place it somewhere."
msgstr "我必须把它放在某个地方，它才有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE"
msgid "To till the corrupt soil."
msgstr "用来翻耕腐坏的土壤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY"
msgid "It is the key to something precious."
msgstr "它是开启宝物的钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK"
msgid "The key to a beautiful place, locked long away."
msgstr "这把钥匙开启的是一个美丽而遥远的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST"
msgid "It sheds light on nothing important."
msgstr "这盏灯照不到重点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT"
msgid "The only light in my life is Abigail."
msgstr "我唯一的人生之光，就是阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
msgid "I am ground down on the mealing stone of life."
msgstr "生活的重担碾压着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "Seclusion has not been kind to it."
msgstr "它与世隔绝，却不得善终。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "I, too, cart around my baggage."
msgstr "我也会带着我的行李前行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "Nothing in there could bring me happiness."
msgstr "那里没有一样东西会给我带来快乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "Maybe we'll get lucky and they'll be poisonous."
msgstr "说不定我们运气好，它们都是有毒的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
msgid "They thrive on a stump made by death."
msgstr "它们在死神创造的树桩上茁壮成长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
msgid "All things die. Even fungus."
msgstr "万物都会消亡，就连菌类也不例外。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
msgid "I never cry."
msgstr "我从不哭泣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED"
msgid "It will never make anyone cry again."
msgstr "它再也无法让谁流泪了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN"
msgid "It looks okay."
msgstr "它看起来不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM"
msgid "Sigh... Why bother?"
msgstr "唉...干嘛那么麻烦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE"
msgid "Looks dangerous."
msgstr "看起来很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL"
msgid "It's winged, but it's no angel."
msgstr "它有翅膀，但不是天使。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2"
msgid "Abigail needs a statue."
msgstr "阿布盖尔需要一尊雕塑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN"
msgid "Long dry."
msgstr "持久干涸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC"
msgid "Now I may enter the park."
msgstr "现在我可以进入公园了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED"
msgid "I need a key to enter."
msgstr "我要有钥匙才能进入。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
msgid "A monument. But not to Abigail."
msgstr "一座纪念碑，但它纪念的不是阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
msgid "Dust to dust."
msgstr "土归土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB"
msgid "Had I such a shell, I would never emerge."
msgstr "假如我长着这样的壳，我绝不会露面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD"
msgid "Cold and dead."
msgstr "冷冰冰，死翘翘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC"
msgid "Would you like to be a pie, little bird?"
msgstr "要不要把你做成馅饼呀，小鸟？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's practicing for the big sleep."
msgstr "它正在为长睡不醒做准备呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
msgid "If only life had been handed to me on a silver plate."
msgstr "如果我是含着银盘子出生的，那多好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "Water, water, everywhere..."
msgstr "水水水，到处都是水..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL"
msgid "There's no night here. It is a nice change."
msgstr "这里没有夜晚。这个变化真不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY"
msgid "Perhaps I'll be happier in the next world."
msgstr "也许我在下一个世界里会快乐些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT"
msgid "We cook to stave off death."
msgstr "我们通过烹饪来抵挡死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO"
msgid "It has eyes, yet it never cries."
msgstr "它有眼睛，却从不哭泣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Now its eyes will never open."
msgstr "从现在起，它的眼睛永远睁不开了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER"
msgid "The hanger is a noose for a pot."
msgstr "这个挂锅装置能把锅勾住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM"
msgid "It's for hanging the pot over the fire."
msgstr "它的作用是把锅悬挂在火的上方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL"
msgid "We will cook, or we will die."
msgstr "我们要么烹饪，要么饿死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP"
msgid "Sweetness begets sweetness."
msgstr "甜蜜的味道会带来甜蜜的生活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP"
msgid "Time came for it."
msgstr "它的时候到了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE"
msgid "Nothing escaped this plague."
msgstr "无一幸免于这场劫难。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE"
msgid "It's been forgotten."
msgstr "它被遗忘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL"
msgid "Nothing more to pray for."
msgstr "没有什么可祈祷的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY"
msgid "This was once a happy home."
msgstr "这里曾经是一个幸福的家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2"
msgid "Its hearth no longer has a home."
msgstr "壁炉底失去了家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK"
msgid "Time is an illusion."
msgstr "时间是一种幻觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER"
msgid "Time is death's ally."
msgstr "时间是死神的盟友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1"
msgid "Death has been here."
msgstr "死神来过这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2"
msgid "It's a ghost town."
msgstr "这是一座鬼城。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3"
msgid "Some tragedy has struck this house."
msgstr "这个房子发生过悲剧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR"
msgid "A door that leads nowhere."
msgstr "一扇不通往任何地方的门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF"
msgid "The roof cannot protect you when death comes."
msgstr "死神降临时，屋顶保护不了你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's have a peek inside..."
msgstr "我们往里面瞧一眼吧..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED"
msgid "Locked, like my heart."
msgstr "锁住了，就像我的心一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON"
msgid "It flops as its life slowly leaves its body."
msgstr "奄奄一息时，它翻了个身。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED"
msgid "Not so lively now."
msgstr "现在没那么活泼了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT"
msgid "It adds flavor..."
msgstr "它能增添风味..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK"
msgid "It needs to be ground down before we can use it."
msgstr "要磨细了才能用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC"
msgid "There is no salt, yet."
msgstr "还没有盐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY"
msgid "There is salt to be had."
msgstr "没有盐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM"
msgid "It's for collecting salt from the pond."
msgstr "它的作用是提取池塘里的盐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP"
msgid "Tree blood."
msgstr "树木的血液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET"
msgid "For collecting tree blood."
msgstr "用来采集树木的血液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING"
msgid "We will perish before this grows back."
msgstr "等它长大的时候，我们早就不复存在了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED"
msgid "As bittersweet as life."
msgstr "就像生活一样有苦有甜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Planting seeds requires an optimism I don't possess."
msgstr "播种需要抱有乐观精神，然而我没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL"
msgid "Is all of life not a slaughter?"
msgstr "人生，不就是一场屠杀吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND"
msgid "Just a dash."
msgstr "就一小撮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose it could be edible."
msgstr "我估计它是可以吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED"
msgid "We've taken all there was to take."
msgstr "能拿的我们都拿完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG"
msgid "We ripped it from its home on the shrub."
msgstr "它长在灌木丛上，我们把它扯下来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It has a sickly beauty."
msgstr "它有一种病态的美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP"
msgid "All things must end."
msgstr "桩桩件件，总有终结的时候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS"
msgid "All that sacrifice for nothing."
msgstr "它们全都白白献身了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY"
msgid "Like a dagger through the heart. A tree heart."
msgstr "犹如匕首穿过心脏，树木的心脏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY"
msgid "I can harvest it now."
msgstr "现在我可以收了它啦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED"
msgid "Its life ebbs."
msgstr "它的生命危在旦夕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG"
msgid "They're less standoffish than their brethren."
msgstr "比起它们的弟兄，它们没那么冷漠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, sir?"
msgstr "你好吗，先生？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "He is practicing for the big sleep."
msgstr "他正在为长睡不醒做准备呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE"
msgid "I see no joy in this house."
msgstr "我在这个房子里看不到半点喜悦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE"
msgid "Neither a house nor a home."
msgstr "既不是房子也不是家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP"
msgid "Not as sweet as Abigail."
msgstr "没有阿比盖尔那么甜美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO"
msgid "Red as heart's blood."
msgstr "红得像血。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Its flesh is far more bloody now."
msgstr "现在它的肉显得更血淋淋了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM"
msgid "How do you do?"
msgstr "你好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2"
msgid "How do you do?"
msgstr "你好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP"
msgid "It's... a turnip."
msgstr "这是个...大萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "The turnip is now cooked."
msgstr "大萝卜煮好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT"
msgid "We can grind it down into flour."
msgstr "我们可以把它磨成面粉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS"
msgid "The life they contain is a mystery."
msgstr "它们孕育的生命，是一个谜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "He's wandering mindlessly, oblivious to his fate."
msgstr "他盲目地四处游荡，对自己的命运一无所知。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "He is safely in my embrace."
msgstr "他在我的怀里很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm too big to fall down there."
msgstr "我个子太大了，没办法掉到洞下面去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "It's closed up. No one is falling down there, now."
msgstr "它已经封死了。现在没人会掉到洞下面去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "It didn't cook well."
msgstr "火候掌握得不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is not as edible as it looks."
msgstr "它并不像看上去那样是可以吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "I liked jumping in puddles with Abigail."
msgstr "我过去喜欢和阿比盖尔在水坑中跳来跳去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "What fun is rain if you're not getting wet?"
msgstr "如果你身上不打湿，下雨还有什么乐趣呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Does that mean sunshine is dead, too?"
msgstr "这意味着阳光也死了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "It measures cloudiness. I like when it's dreary."
msgstr "它能测出是否有雨。我喜欢沉闷的天气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "A whole bunch of cooked vegetables. Riveting."
msgstr "一大锅烩蔬菜，非常吸引人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "This is just for shaving."
msgstr "仅用于剃毛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "Red like my heart's blood."
msgstr "像我的鲜血一样红。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "A light to guide me."
msgstr "指引我的亮光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "Now Wolfgang won't get \"lost\" when I invite him to play."
msgstr "现在当我邀请他的时候，沃尔夫冈不会“迷路”了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "What lies within?"
msgstr "里面有什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "A mushroom after my own heart."
msgstr "知心的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "All is malleable."
msgstr "全都是有韧性的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Damp."
msgstr "它湿湿的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "I would hide too, if I could."
msgstr "如果可以的话，我也想藏起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Harvested."
msgstr "采掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "Soon to be ashes."
msgstr "很快就化为灰烬了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just a bunch of reeds."
msgstr "这只是一簇芦苇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "They have already been torn away."
msgstr "它们已经被剥落了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Everything's a vest."
msgstr "任何东西都可以做成背心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "A leftover of an ancient world."
msgstr "远古世界的遗物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "It is unspeakably burnt."
msgstr "它被烧得面目全非。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "I will learn unspeakable things."
msgstr "我会学到无法形容的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "It is unspeakably burnt."
msgstr "它被烧得面目全非。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "I will learn unspeakable things."
msgstr "我会学到无法形容的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "It is unspeakably burnt."
msgstr "它被烧得面目全非。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "I have learnt unspeakable things."
msgstr "我学到了无法形容的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "Madness brings fire."
msgstr "疯狂行为引来了大火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "This is but a step from madness."
msgstr "距离疯狂只有一步之遥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "I'm glad that fail-safe is gone."
msgstr "我很高兴，保险措施失效了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just putting off the inevitable."
msgstr "只是将不可避免的死亡延迟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "A futile ward."
msgstr "一个没用的守卫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "Choices matter."
msgstr "选择很重要。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "Brotherly camaraderie will not save you."
msgstr "兄弟情也救不了你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Does that mean spring is coming? I hope not."
msgstr "这意味着春天来了吗？希望不是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "He likes being trapped in my pocket."
msgstr "他喜欢被困在我的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Life in the barren, frozen wastes."
msgstr "寒荒之地的生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "It's so soft. It is my enemy."
msgstr "它如此柔软。它是我的敌人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "I wonder what they did."
msgstr "我想知道它干了什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "Even that is not permanent."
msgstr "连这个都不是永恒的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "Some small rocks."
msgstr "一些小石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "What terrible sights they have seen."
msgstr "他们看到了多么可怕的景象。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "A large piece of cold, unfeeling ice."
msgstr "一大块冰冷无情的冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "A large pool of cool, melted ice."
msgstr "一大滩冰凉的融冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "A large pool of cool, melted ice."
msgstr "一大滩冰凉的融冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "There's a fire in the pit's belly."
msgstr "那个坑洞里有一团火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The shadows encroach."
msgstr "阴影来袭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "The lava's on fire."
msgstr "熔岩着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "The lava lost its will to burn..."
msgstr "岩浆失去了燃烧的意愿..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "It's traveled so far..."
msgstr "它跨越了遥不可及的距离..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Now it will never die..."
msgstr "现在它会长生不死..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "Now it will never die..."
msgstr "现在它会长生不死..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "A Rook? Or is it a Castle?"
msgstr "战车？还是城堡？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Time erodes everything."
msgstr "时间会侵蚀一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "That would be the easy way out of this place."
msgstr "这会是一种轻松的解脱方式。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "The way of all things."
msgstr "万物皆如此。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "We stole it out of the mouths of baby bees."
msgstr "我们从蜜蜂宝宝的嘴里偷出了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Broken bits of stone."
msgstr "破碎的石块。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "Abigail would've loved this crown."
msgstr "阿比盖尔会喜欢这个王冠的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "It possesses the power of the ancients."
msgstr "它拥有古人的力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "A pile of broken dreams."
msgstr "一堆破碎的梦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It is touched by death."
msgstr "它被死亡所感动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "It judges my very being."
msgstr "它正在评判我的存在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "I'm only taking back what's mine."
msgstr "我只是拿回属于我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "As if it wasn't already burdened by the yoke of life..."
msgstr "好像它还没有负担生活的重荷..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "Too much whimsy gives me indigestion."
msgstr "无法理解太多的怪念头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "Oh, how we bend creatures to our ill intent."
msgstr "哦，怎样让各种生物屈服于我们邪恶的意图。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "The beasts crave it..."
msgstr "野兽们渴望它..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Mockery of a spoiled childhood."
msgstr "被宠坏的小孩的嘲笑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Aim for my heart..."
msgstr "瞄准我的心脏..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "It's calling to me."
msgstr "它在召唤我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Even this obelisk has left me."
msgstr "就连这个方尖碑也离我而去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Consigned to the flames."
msgstr "交给火焰了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "It's not long for this world..."
msgstr "它不再留恋这个世界..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "It is on the precipice..."
msgstr "它在悬崖上..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's trying to grow up."
msgstr "它在努力生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Maybe next time, sapling."
msgstr "也许下次吧，小树苗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "The oppressive heat got to this one."
msgstr "高温干掉了这一棵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "Antagonizing crows is always bad luck."
msgstr "对抗乌鸦总是运气不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Now the crows will be at peace."
msgstr "现在乌鸦会平静下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Who would want to scare crows away?"
msgstr "谁会想要把乌鸦吓走？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "The flame has cleansed this poor wretched soul."
msgstr "火焰净化了这个不幸的灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Abigail... You be Death, I'll be the Sculptor..."
msgstr "阿比盖尔... 你当死神，我当雕塑师..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "...I can't be disappointed... If I expect nothing..."
msgstr "...如果我没什么期望...就不会失望..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "That looks... f-fun..."
msgstr "那看起来...很...有趣..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "Cleft from the stone."
msgstr "从石头裂开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "A beautiful corruption gnaws at its base..."
msgstr "美丽的腐败在它的底部啃噬..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Not everyone can be put back together after falling apart."
msgstr "不是每个人在崩溃后都能复原。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "It wants out..."
msgstr "它想要出去..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "The more the marble wastes, the more the statue grows."
msgstr "大理石浪费得越多，雕像成长得越快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "How did this get here?"
msgstr "这东西是怎么到这里来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "There's a sickly beauty to it..."
msgstr "它有种病态美..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "If only the rest of us could be whole again."
msgstr "要是我们剩下的人可以再次成为一个整体。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "It wants out..."
msgstr "它想要出去..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "We all have monsters within, I suppose."
msgstr "我们内心都有怪物，我猜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Off with his head! Heehee."
msgstr "他的头掉了！嘻嘻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I feel... queasy..."
msgstr "我感觉...反胃..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "It's been made whole again. Lucky."
msgstr "它又是个整体了。幸运。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "It wants out..."
msgstr "它想要出去..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Perhaps it wanted to hide the shame of its monstrous form?"
msgstr "也许它想要把它对怪物形态的羞愧藏起来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Strange marble debris..."
msgstr "奇怪的大理石碎片..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Life, or at least the promise of it."
msgstr "生命，或者至少是孕育生命的希望。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "The fire has toasted their life away."
msgstr "火烤干了他们的生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Grant us the power of sight..."
msgstr "授予我们看见的力量..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "Another implement for staving off the inevitable decay."
msgstr "另一种推迟不可避免的耐久下降的方法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "It doesn't mend the hole... merely masks it."
msgstr "它没有修补这个洞...只是掩饰住而已。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Was he your brother?"
msgstr "他是你哥哥吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "It beats with a sorrow to span the skies and plumb the darkest seas."
msgstr "它的跳动伴随着悲伤，跨越了天空，探测最黑暗的大海。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "What terrible secrets might be uncovered with this?"
msgstr "这到底揭示了什么可怕的秘密？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "A reminder of the death we wrought."
msgstr "我们锻造的死亡提醒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "A preview of the fires of Hell."
msgstr "地狱之火的预演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A siesta is but a preview of death."
msgstr "午休只是死亡的预演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "So slippery and fine."
msgstr "如此光滑而精美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "I envy your escape."
msgstr "你解脱了，我很嫉妒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "A tortured mind dwelled within."
msgstr "里面压迫着被拷打的理智。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "I envy you, %s. Maybe I should play with %s?"
msgstr "我羡慕你，%s。也许我应该和 %s 玩玩？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "I envy you, %s. Maybe I should play with %s?"
msgstr "我羡慕你，%s。也许我应该和 %s 玩玩？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "I envy you, %s. Maybe I should play with %s?"
msgstr "我羡慕你，%s。也许我应该和 %s 玩玩？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "I envy you, %s. Maybe I should play with %s?"
msgstr "我羡慕你，%s。也许我应该和 %s 玩玩？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "I think we could make what's drawn here..."
msgstr "我想我们可以制造出这里画的东西..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "It shall contain my memento mori."
msgstr "那里面应该有我的死亡警告。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "Sickly spores bring such sweet slumber."
msgstr "病态的孢子带来这样甜蜜的睡眠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "Ah, to be so simple."
msgstr "啊，这么简单。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "An empty bag of hunger."
msgstr "一个空的饥饿口袋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "An empty bag of hunger."
msgstr "一个空的饥饿口袋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "It is mindlessly chasing after rocks."
msgstr "它盲目地追逐着石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "It certainly didn't help the original owner."
msgstr "它肯定对原来的主人没什么帮助。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "The slurtles pop out when they outgrow it."
msgstr "尖壳蜗牛长得太大的时候就会从里面出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "It shimmers with slimy anticipation."
msgstr "它闪烁着微光，看上去就很黏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Pieces of broken slurtle dreams."
msgstr "尖壳蜗牛梦想的碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello there, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，你好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Are you empty inside?"
msgstr "你身体里面空虚吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "A black hole from which seeds never return."
msgstr "一个黑洞，种子有去无回。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "It smells like tiny fear."
msgstr "闻起来像小小的恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Meat, turned dry and delicious."
msgstr "肉晾干了，很美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "Death will be a blessing."
msgstr "死亡会是一种福气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "That one has a larger shell."
msgstr "那个蜗牛的壳更大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "I should put it out of its misery."
msgstr "我应该让它从痛苦中解脱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "They who wield it shall become the destroyer of worlds."
msgstr "使用它的人将会成为世界的毁灭者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "To cut and slash..."
msgstr "用来切割和挥砍..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Such a brutal weapon..."
msgstr "多么残暴的武器..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "It seems a tad dramatic."
msgstr "这似乎有点戏剧性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "We will meet again some day."
msgstr "总有一天我们会重逢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "A creature of the night!"
msgstr "夜行生物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Evil is sleeping."
msgstr "恶魔睡着了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "A nest of filth and villainy."
msgstr "一窝乌合之众。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "A tiny package full of death and destruction."
msgstr "满是死亡和毁灭的小包裹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "Even in death, this beast causes pain."
msgstr "即使死去，这只野兽仍能制造伤痛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Time to stare into the abyss."
msgstr "是时候凝视深渊了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "It is infested."
msgstr "这里到处都是蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "It is infested."
msgstr "这里到处都是蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "She is regal in her horribleness."
msgstr "她像帝王般残酷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "The darkness has drained the color from their fur."
msgstr "黑暗褪去了它们身上的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "A cowardly spider."
msgstr "一只胆小的蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "It's chewing on something."
msgstr "它在嚼着什么东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "Alas, brave warrior."
msgstr "唉，勇敢的战士。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "A warrior of the night!"
msgstr "夜行勇士！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "I must beware."
msgstr "我必须小心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "Everything turns to waste, eventually."
msgstr "最终一切都会变成垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Its life is short, but beautiful."
msgstr "它的生命很短暂，但是很美好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "So many have perished. But this one is safe."
msgstr "许多已经消亡。但这个很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has no concept of time, or loss."
msgstr "它丝毫没有时间的概念，或者失去的概念。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "So many have perished. But this one is safe."
msgstr "许多已经消亡。但这个很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Be free, little one!"
msgstr "自由飞翔吧，小家伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "So many have perished. But this one is safe."
msgstr "许多已经消亡。但这个很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Stars die like everything else..."
msgstr "星星像其他东西一样死去..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "I can almost make out a tiny solar system."
msgstr "我几乎能做出一个小小的太阳能系统。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Some weather out there."
msgstr "制造一点坏天气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "A creature of shadow that seeks the light... how sad..."
msgstr "寻求光亮的暗影生物...真可悲啊..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "My heart aches with its beauty."
msgstr "我的心随着它的美丽而疼痛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "The earth gives up its bounty."
msgstr "大地慷慨地奉献了这些岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "The earth reaches up."
msgstr "大地的奇观。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "Not even death is permanent."
msgstr "甚至连死亡也不是永恒的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "Do you mourn, too?"
msgstr "你也在哀伤吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Death would be a kindness."
msgstr "死亡可能是一种仁慈。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Death has claimed it."
msgstr "死亡夺走了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "What IS that?!"
msgstr "那是什么？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Maybe these statues will keep me company."
msgstr "也许这些雕像将一直伴我左右。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "Did it go as you planned?"
msgstr "它和你计划的一样吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Cold, hard stone..."
msgstr "寒冷、坚硬的石头..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Each of us wear many masks..."
msgstr "我们每个人都戴着许多面具..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "A chilling thought... what if nothing's beneath the mask?"
msgstr "令人恐惧的想法...如果面具下面什么也没有怎么办呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "This offers no hope of warmth."
msgstr "这个不能提供温暖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "Sharp and deadly."
msgstr "锋利而致命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "When the sun beats mercilessly, life finds a way. Ugh."
msgstr "太阳无情地鞭挞，生命找到一种方式。啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "A nightshade. Probably not filled with poison."
msgstr "一只茄子，里面大概没有塞满毒药。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "Plucked from the safety of its desert home."
msgstr "从它在沙漠中安全的家里拔出。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "Life is resilient."
msgstr "生命是很顽强的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "This gilded cage is ceramic."
msgstr "这个镀金的笼子是陶瓷的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT"
msgid "A cruel trick!"
msgstr "残忍的骗局！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "Pieces of dead things, made into a vest!"
msgstr "背心是用一块块死去的东西做成的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Who knew such sweet things could exist here?"
msgstr "谁知道这些美味的东西怎么会生长在这里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Free from the shackles of the sky."
msgstr "摆脱天空的桎梏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "So full of potential."
msgstr "充满了潜力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "All that promise, snatched away. Not bad with bacon."
msgstr "所有希望都被夺走了。和培根搭配起来不赖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Chilled by the darkness."
msgstr "因黑暗而感到寒冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "A tiny, fragile being, struggling for the light."
msgstr "小小的脆弱生命，正在挣扎着迎向光明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "It cannot bear the heat."
msgstr "它承受不了这样的高温。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "A life sooner begun is a life sooner ended."
msgstr "越早诞生，越早消亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "Soon now."
msgstr "就快出来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "That egg represents a new life. Ugh."
msgstr "这个蛋代表了一个新生命。呃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty. Vacant. Barren. A void."
msgstr "巢是空的。空虚、贫瘠而虚无。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Will you leave too?"
msgstr "你也要离开我？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "We all try to fill the void."
msgstr "我们都想填补空虚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Your true nature is revealed!"
msgstr "你露出了本性！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "The focus is so lifeless."
msgstr "传送焦点是如此死气沉沉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "Energy flows through it."
msgstr "能量从中流过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "I'm sure the next realm will be even more horrible!"
msgstr "我确信下一个地方会更可怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "No good can come of this."
msgstr "它不会带来什么好事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "It's still locked shut."
msgstr "它仍然是上锁关闭的状态。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "Is it half built, or half destroyed?"
msgstr "它是建了一半，还是毁了一半？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "It contains a vital spark."
msgstr "它包含着至关重要的火花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "It looks complicated."
msgstr "它看起来很复杂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "What a hideous creation!"
msgstr "多么丑陋的产物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "It has no sharp edges."
msgstr "它没有锋利的边缘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "We could escape if it were more powerful."
msgstr "如果它更强大一些，我们就可以解脱了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "A preview of the fires of Hell."
msgstr "地狱之火的预演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sleep is but a preview of death."
msgstr "睡眠只是死亡的预演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "Long, thin and dangerous!"
msgstr "又瘦又长又危险！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Sharp, slimy and dangerous."
msgstr "锋利、黏滑而危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "These are better left unmentioned."
msgstr "这些事最好略过不提。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "This one is different."
msgstr "这东西是不同的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "So this is what goes on down below."
msgstr "所以这就是下面的情况了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Babies!"
msgstr "小触手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "It shall return, some day."
msgstr "有一天它会回来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "Its presence marks the edge of the unknown."
msgstr "它的存在标志着未知的边界。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Fragments of a powerful material."
msgstr "强大材料的碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "An ember that burns with the stuff of nightmares."
msgstr "与噩梦素材一同燃烧的灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "Just swallow us whole and end our misery."
msgstr "吞了我们，结束我们的痛苦吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "I think I'll be reunited with Abigail soon."
msgstr "我想我很快会和阿比盖尔重聚了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "Just like the one in my heart."
msgstr "就像我心里的那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "Look how whimsical it is... We must kill it."
msgstr "看它多古怪...我们必须杀了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Something has filled the void. In the ground, I mean."
msgstr "某些东西填补了空白。我是说在地里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "A piece of finery to help forget the inescapable wild."
msgstr "一件华美的服饰，帮助遗忘无法逃避的荒野。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "A tiny bulwark against the night."
msgstr "对抗黑夜的小小武器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "The way is clear."
msgstr "道路畅通了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "For when I don't want to be alone..."
msgstr "当我不想独自一人的时候..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "Take me far from here."
msgstr "带我离开这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It came from the belly of the sphinx."
msgstr "它来自斯芬克斯的胃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "A handful of sustenance."
msgstr "一把食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "You shall fall."
msgstr "你应该倒下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Electrical doo-what?"
msgstr "它叫晶体什么来着？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "Simple grass has become deadly."
msgstr "小小的草也变得致命了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "A devious surprise from underground."
msgstr "来自地下的卑劣意外。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "Death when I least expect it."
msgstr "猝不及防的死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "It couldn't even hold ashes."
msgstr "它连灰烬都装不了了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "For which to contain my lucre."
msgstr "它装着我的财富。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Every once in awhile, things go my way."
msgstr "偶尔，事情的发展会符合我的心意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "Was this placed intentionally?"
msgstr "这是故意放的吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD"
msgid "It was summoned by the death of its family..."
msgstr "它因它家人死亡召集而来…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "Perfectly misshapen."
msgstr "非常奇异。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Another mouth to feed."
msgstr "另一张要喂饱的嘴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "I warned you, WX, never ingest bottles labeled \"Drink me.\""
msgstr "我警告你，WX，绝对不要喝下标记有“请喝我”的瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "Not so slimy any more, are we?"
msgstr "不再那么黏滑了，不是吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "I'd carry this to the end of the world."
msgstr "我会带着这个，直到世界末日。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I wish my life force would drain away like the tea."
msgstr "我希望我的生命像茶一样耗尽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "Winning with only one piece is hopeless."
msgstr "只有一片的胜利是无望的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "Winning with only one piece is hopeless."
msgstr "只有一片的胜利是无望的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "Two utensils that are one. It reminds me of myself and Abigail."
msgstr "两个厨具其实是一个。这让我想起我和阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "It conceals tragedy."
msgstr "它隐藏了悲剧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "The spinning inevitably ends, just like life."
msgstr "纺锤必然停止转动，如同生命必然终结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "Just a temptation, like death."
msgstr "只是个诱惑，就像死亡一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "My back doesn't need scratching."
msgstr "我的背不需要抓。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "This tool has come to the end of its life."
msgstr "这个工具再也无法使用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I'm not a-frayed."
msgstr "我不怕的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "I don't have a use for it."
msgstr "我不需要它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "I've never been lucky."
msgstr "我从不走运。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "It smells of decay and death."
msgstr "有腐烂和死亡的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "That potato is as hollow as I am."
msgstr "土豆和我一样空洞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "Now at least the wardrobe can be organized."
msgstr "现在至少衣柜是井井有条的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "A horse! A horse! My castle for a horse!"
msgstr "一匹马！一匹马！我的城堡换一匹马！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "A horse! A horse! My castle for a horse!"
msgstr "一匹马！一匹马！我的城堡换一匹马！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "If only knives solved more of my problems..."
msgstr "要是小刀能解决所有问题该有多好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "I'd rather have the castle..."
msgstr "我宁愿拥有城堡..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "I'd rather have the castle..."
msgstr "我宁愿拥有城堡..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "When I gaze into the ball I see... nothing. Apropos."
msgstr "当我盯着球的时候我...什么也没看见。恰好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "It's very fetching."
msgstr "非常迷人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "Perhaps a curse could end our suffering."
msgstr "也许一个诅咒会结束我们的痛苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Neither half empty, nor half full."
msgstr "要么半空，要么半满。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Now Webber and I can match."
msgstr "现在韦伯和我合得起来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Drive it through my heart and be done."
msgstr "将它穿过我的心脏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "It makes the world look as insignificant as I feel."
msgstr "它使这个世界看起来就像我的感觉一样微不足道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "One lonely half of a pair."
msgstr "孤独的一半。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "I'd carry this to the end of the world."
msgstr "我会带着这个，直到世界末日。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "The weight of the world rests upon me."
msgstr "整个世界都压在我身上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "It looks like ectoplasm in there."
msgstr "里面似乎有灵质。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "To frolic, to play, no more."
msgstr "嬉闹，玩耍，就没别的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "I have put childish things behind me."
msgstr "我已经把幼稚的东西都抛在身后。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Some breaks cannot be mended."
msgstr "一些裂痕是修补不了的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It is so colorful..."
msgstr "色彩好鲜艳..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "I simply do not know what it is."
msgstr "我根本不知道这是什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "I'll hold onto it... but only for a friend."
msgstr "我会抓紧它不放...但仅仅是为了一个朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "Once alive with electricity, they've met their end."
msgstr "曾经因通电而有了生命，现在已经走到了尽头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "Just a simple game."
msgstr "只是一个简单的游戏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "I wish I could take a bath."
msgstr "我希望可以洗个澡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Mismatched buttons for a mismatched life."
msgstr "不搭的纽扣，乱搭的人生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Skin to wear over your skin."
msgstr "穿在你皮肤上的一层皮肤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "It may warm the body, but what of the spirit?"
msgstr "它也许能温暖身体，但对灵魂有什么用呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "It looks even worse now."
msgstr "现在看上去更糟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "I would have preferred the ears."
msgstr "我更喜欢耳朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "Separated from its only friend."
msgstr "和它唯一的朋友分开了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "Alone, and rolling through life."
msgstr "一生都在孤单地滚动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "Some ground."
msgstr "一些地皮。"

