#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
