msgstr "他们休息了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "No sense wasting materials."
