#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
