msgstr "胜过一个市场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL"
