msgstr "这应该能增添浓郁的风味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC"
