msgstr "多一些亮光总不是坏事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL"
