msgstr "看起来麻麻点点的！哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
