msgstr "装备此物品可更改角色的背景画像。\n\n\n\n这些柱子上四个堆叠的猪头代表了猪可以数到几。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_yotp5
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_yotp5"
